


translate english day_3_5511b3fc:


    Pupils "He’s the one who hated Baburin."


translate english day_3_d4ab69a7:


    Pupils "You think he did it?"


translate english day_3_68633620:


    Pupils "I've heard he’s a weirdo."


translate english day_3_b22bad13:


    "The “warm” farewells Romka and Byasha shouted at the back of fleeing Semyon echoed inside my head."


translate english day_3_0d0b8162:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/Gorlo tebe pererezu.ogg"
    Rom "I’ll cut your throat, you hear?"


translate english day_3_4fabca73:


    "Porky!"


translate english day_3_8b7d551a:


    "Was Romka serious about his threats?"


translate english day_3_c7844405:


    "Would he chase his former friend deep into the forest and…"


translate english day_3_858a5533:


    "…and then what?"


translate english day_3_f44b3bb2:


    "Kill him, just like that?"


translate english day_3_a9a10155:


    "No, that can’t be right."


translate english day_3_a558dadc:


    "I hurriedly rubbed my glasses…"


translate english day_3_c0a4862c:


    "The glasses!"


translate english day_3_8c6ca273:


    "Semyon was clutching them in his fist while trying to escape the barrage of kicks and slaps from his friends."


translate english day_3_32cf139f:


    "Former friends by now."


translate english day_3_1edc4309:


    "Semyon was clutching them in his fist while I was getting beaten up."


translate english day_3_900569a0:


    "And in just a couple of hours, this lost item was lying on the ledge of my window."


translate english day_3_f09a2181:


    "It was hard to imagine that Syoma suddenly got guilty conscience and returned my glasses in such a strange way."


translate english day_3_17592673:


    "I was shocked but kept walking toward the classroom, accompanied by nasty whispers all around me."


translate english day_3_109ec4c6:


    "That photo still stood before my eyes."


translate english day_3_72bb47e4:


    "Semyon has gone missing. Semyon is gone."


translate english day_3_9a1ce771:


    "His fat fingers will never get to my throat, his signet ring won’t smash into my chin, he’ll never humiliate me again."


translate english day_3_a856b955:


    "Wasn’t that what I wished for?"


translate english day_3_9ccd61e3:


    "On the other hand…"


translate english day_3_1350441a:


    "Did I really wish Semyon to become a murky stain on the notice board?"


translate english day_3_c6777f58:


    "He was still someone’s son, or a grandson, and he went through the same struggles as me."


translate english day_3_d8806ea7:


    "Did I really wish for my unseen companion to dispatch him in such a brutal fashion?"


translate english day_3_2561a66e:


    "I didn’t know the answer."


translate english day_3_5ec9a56f:


    "Or I was just scared of it."


translate english day_3_ffb6db5d:


    "Nonetheless, school still had something nice about it."


translate english day_3_3be390e9:


    "Polina, the girl with a violin, was like a mountain spring, like well water that you gulp down, pressing your lips against the zinc outer ring of a bucket, and can’t ever get enough."


translate english day_3_f1913717:


    "Remembering our walk yesterday cooled off my head."


translate english day_3_637a0ed4:


    "Polina’s hatred toward dogs, while understandable, was still alarming."


translate english day_3_cdb1227d:


    "Could a charming girl like her really be nesting something so repulsive inside her heart?"


translate english day_3_da36f171:


    "I immediately remembered my dad’s shady past that recently resurfaced."


translate english day_3_42d7861a:


    "A person I idolized was the reason for us moving to this bleak countryside…"


translate english day_3_449e789d:


    "…at least he was according to mom’s screams that were coming from the other side of the wall."


translate english day_3_e0cfce2b:


    "Still, Polina tried to defend me from a delinquent gang, even if she failed at it."


translate english day_3_2b92bdcc:


    "She was pleading for Romka to leave me alone and gathered my belongings that were strewn around the forest while fighting tears."


translate english day_3_ddb3c473:


    "And when those bastards tried to drag her away, she resisted with all the might she had in her fragile body."


translate english day_3_aedce036:


    "In the end, she was the one to find my house, lost among the taiga, and told my dad that I lied there alone in the dark, abandoned in the middle of the forest after the beating."


translate english day_3_59cbb314:


    "Maybe I’m being too harsh on her."


translate english day_3_6f9d7488:


    "What if I make her one of the characters in the story I’ll draw? The protagonist will save her from terrifying monsters!"


translate english day_3_d90e0be1:


    "As soon as I thought of monsters, a bunch of my classmates slid down the rails, smirking like the xenomorphs from “The Alien”."


translate english day_3_b0b21915:


    "I immediately felt larvae of fear writhe in my stomach."


translate english day_3_b9600458:


    "I didn’t want to cross paths with Romka and Byasha after what happened yesterday, especially since Semyon suddenly went missing."


translate english day_3_5d8c2d3a:


    "Polina seemed eager to talk to me but her expression soured after noticing the aforementioned duo, and she walked past, leaving me a single sorry look."


translate english day_3_5ed7bbfb:


    "I entered the classroom and went toward the last row."


translate english day_3_8908134a:


    "All of the chatter suddenly died down so I walked there in complete silence."


translate english day_3_f03289a8:


    "It felt like my classmates pushed and poked me with their stares, they carefully observed my every move."


translate english day_3_637d6879:


    "They looked at me with a mortifying mix of pity, ridicule and derision. Like a scientist looks at an ugly representative of a newfound species of worms."


translate english day_3_8edde09d:


    "I stared at the desk with a huge pile of library textbooks on top, my fists clenched."


translate english day_3_f30a1f3b:


    "It felt like I was the one who disappeared in that snowy forest and my desk was finally used for something worthwhile."


translate english day_3_31a45392:


    "Semyon’s empty chair stood in front of me. The chair that once belonged to Vova gathered dust somewhere in another classroom."


translate english d3_look_projector_65dfeeda:


    "Filmoscope."


translate english d3_look_projector_ca727c97:


    "There was a time when I had a lot of cool fairy tales that we used to watch with dad in complete darkness."


translate english d3_look_projector_5694109a:


    "I was immediately swept away by the memory of the projector’s hum, of its hot casing, of its bright rays hitting the wall, turning it into a screen."


translate english d3_look_projector_88d5a840:


    "It’s a pity that the school’s slides were mostly about minerals and PSAs."


translate english d3_look_esenin_f0ef6cfe:


    "Portraits of classical writers."


translate english d3_look_esenin_fe2bd8d4:


    "Last year, I was tasked with learning any poem, and dad suggested I learn one about the dog Jim, written by Esenin."


translate english d3_look_esenin_0b99237b:


    "I don’t remember all the stanzas by now, but the last one was somehow deeply ingrained in my memory:"


translate english d3_look_esenin_43a2a40a:


    "\"I'm sure she'll come here. In my absence\nPlease catch her eye. Go kiss her hand for me,"


translate english d3_look_esenin_aeca221d:


    "For all my real or fancied errors asking\nForgiveness of her in humility."


translate english d3_look_box_50b0bace:


    "Especially inside an archway. It is said that they’re produced in China and that a single one of them can blow your fingers off if you light it up and clutch it in your hand."


translate english day_3_continue_e0da213a:


    "After a moment of hesitation, I sat down at Baburin’s desk, the place where I was supposed to be assigned by Lilia Pavlovna at first."


translate english day_3_continue_d2330cc3:


    "The chatter resumed, as if someone just unpaused a movie."


translate english day_3_continue_fb76a43b:



    voice "voice/kate/79 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Baburin’s grandma made such a fuss when he didn’t return home."


translate english day_3_continue_eaa2ce90:



    voice "voice/kate/80 KA.ogg"
    Kate "First, she ran to the school, then called the cops."


translate english day_3_continue_ed023b1f:



    voice "voice/kate/81 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english day_3_continue_7a51cda3:


    "Katya snuck a cunning glance at me, then leaned in to her neighbor and whispered something."


translate english day_3_continue_3aaca832:


    "I kept catching her stare on myself. Her neighbor stared, too. The whole class was watching me."


translate english day_3_continue_4108be6a:


    "It was like they felt the need to watch me because…"


translate english day_3_continue_f1b4e522:


    "They were searching for traces of blood on my fingers."


translate english day_3_continue_37a04f83:


    "I wanted to defend myself and shout: “Guys, listen, I’m innocent!”"


translate english day_3_continue_2389ad1f:


    "Romka gave me a heavy, worried look."


translate english day_3_continue_0e7e9f4e:


    "He was probably as stunned by Semyon's disappearance as everybody else."


translate english day_3_continue_bb1f63ef:


    "But then he directed his stare straight at my face."


translate english day_3_continue_f8129103:


    "The delinquents turned around and stared at me in silence."


translate english day_3_continue_b47fa530:


    "Their looks were dripping with malice."


translate english day_3_continue_087559fd:


    "But why?"


translate english day_3_continue_bbaa86c7:


    "What did I do to them? Their friend went missing and they’re still focused on me."


translate english day_3_continue_e00966ca:


    "Sudddenly, I noticed Byasha drilling a hole in my nose with his eyes. "


translate english day_3_continue_908c02b2:


    "It felt like he was about to point his finger at me and shout at the top of his lungs:"


translate english day_3_continue_0de233fe:


    "But he remained silent as if there was nothing special at all about my glasses."


translate english day_3_continue_c9430732:


    "I may be going mad, but I think Byasha knows something. He knows something but he won’t tell me what."


translate english day_3_continue_4a0bb051:


    "I may be going mad, but I think Romka knows something. He knows something but he won’t tell me what."


translate english day_3_continue_9b40204c:


    "But it was also possible he didn't care at all. Just like everyone else."


translate english day_3_continue_96b3e2b2:


    "Then Romka shifted his eyebrows in suspicion and stared at Katya, as if informing her that he didn’t believe a word she said."


translate english day_3_continue_b6c3bf3e:


    "I wanted to believe that Romka would take my side."


translate english day_3_continue_25a065e5:


    "And Byasha, who sat sprawled in his chair, with his chin pressed against the table, too."


translate english day_3_continue_cf5e8e6d:


    "But they were silent."


translate english day_3_continue_c9f5c197:


    "A terrifying thought flashed in my mind. Those two could easily betray me, push me off the cliff."


translate english day_3_continue_4d64e2a4:


    "Just like they did with Semyon."


translate english day_3_continue_9508a23b:


    "Roma gave me a meaningful glance, as if reminding me of his promise."


translate english day_3_continue_4a9d59a0:


    "My aching temple reminded me of it. I needed to stay away from Polina."


translate english day_3_continue_d5038291:


    "As if looking for protection, I clutched the ruler until my hand hurt."


translate english day_3_continue_30aadd60:



    voice "voice/kate/87 KA.ogg"
    Kate "You don’t have to be {u}Columbo{/u} to solve this…"


translate english day_3_continue_b43836a4:



    voice "voice/kate/88 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Who held a grudge against Baburin?"


translate english day_3_continue_639517e8:



    voice "voice/kate/89 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Who hit him yesterday? Bullied him and then…"


translate english day_3_continue_780031dd:


    "The metal ruler fell out of my weak fingers. It hit the floor with a jingle and that made the other kids shudder."


translate english day_3_continue_cc951a04:


    "Katya bit her tongue and squirmed nervously."


translate english day_3_continue_171dde4b:


    "Chairs scraped against the floor. My classmates moved away from me, closer to the exit, toward the teacher’s desk."


translate english day_3_continue_6779d25a:


    "I was not the only one to catch wind of that change. Romka and Byasha looked around and winced in contempt."


translate english day_3_continue_005bbb2c:


    "Too bad that they weren’t afraid of me like everybody else."


translate english day_3_continue_d6de9ec2:


    "It’s good that they were clearly on my side."


translate english day_3_continue_b7e30369:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/71 Da.ogg"
    Bya "Shut it."


translate english day_3_continue_6e461953:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/72 Ba.ogg"
    Bya "I betcha Baburin just got a whippin’ from his old hag and ran off."


translate english day_3_continue_daa17f1d:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/73 Sc.ogg"
    Bya "They’ll find him soon."


translate english day_3_continue_82562d22:



    voice "voice/kate/90 KA.ogg"
    Kate "They’ll find him alright."


translate english day_3_continue_13930f3c:



    voice "voice/kate/91 KA.ogg"
    Kate "In a ravine, with his stomach cut open!"


translate english day_3_continue_71e470a7:


    "I gulped."


translate english day_3_continue_82dd24de:


    "I imagined Syoma on a snowy blanket: his face, white like a fish belly, split down the middle by the crevice of his mouth, snowflakes falling on his glassy eyes and filling up his throat."


translate english day_3_continue_6a5efe49:


    "\"See\", I could almost hear his condescending tone, \"it’s all your fault!\""


translate english day_3_continue_a7b9dc2f:


    "But why was Semyon the only one get his just desserts for bullying me?"


translate english day_3_continue_f1031f9d:


    Ant_m "Weren’t all of them supposed to disappear? Romka, Bysha, Katya, along with every laughing onlooker?"


translate english day_3_continue_541ffce5:


    "Of course, Semyon did me a favor by disappearing. Thanks to him, my classmates now stared at me in awe."


translate english day_3_continue_1e1c68af:


    "But that was only one side of the coin."


translate english day_3_continue_8f21df61:


    "What if I’ll have to repay that favor soon?"


translate english day_3_continue_0dbc0223:


    "The door creaked. Polina entered the classroom."


translate english day_3_continue_24f6ba17:


    "I straightened up in a hurry so she wouldn’t see me looking like a scared critter."


translate english day_3_continue_1187af25:


    "Polina went to her seat without looking at me."


translate english day_3_continue_eeee4e0c:


    "Polina found me with her eyes, gave me a short nod, and went to her seat."


translate english day_3_continue_b4b956a0:


    "Katya rushed to her neighbors again, like a lab rat that saw a treat, and started whispering, switching her gaze between me and Polina."


translate english day_3_continue_72c7f978:


    "Messages on pieces of paper started jumping around the classroom."


translate english day_3_continue_2159143a:


    "The ringer’s trill announced the start of the class."


translate english day_3_continue_ae58b388:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/01 Tak.ogg"
    Teacher "Alright, stop messing around. Class, stand up."


translate english day_3_continue_fe1c2d01:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/02 Pe.ogg"
    Teacher "You too, Petrov!"


translate english day_3_continue_4638d7c1:


    "Lilia Pavlovna went to her desk, followed by a policeman in a uniform."


translate english day_3_continue_f410cd37:


    "It was the man that visited us just recently: tall, and his stare so sharp you could get cut on it."


translate english day_3_continue_f11d7f31:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/21Z.ogg"
    Mil "Ahem... hello there, kids."


translate english day_3_continue_f30f9558:



    voice "voice/Child/3day/02 Zdras.ogg"
    Childs "Hi!"


translate english day_3_continue_a63d705f:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/03 S.ogg"
    Teacher "You can sit down, kids."


translate english day_3_continue_142136e4:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/04 P.ogg"
    Teacher "This is senior lieutenant Konstantin Vladimirovich Tikhonov."


translate english day_3_continue_d967df98:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/05 On.ogg"
    Teacher "He’s going to ask you a couple of question and give you a small PSA."


translate english day_3_continue_000a4690:


    "The class livened up: talking to a policemen was way better than studying!"


translate english day_3_continue_ae045e3e:


    "I, on the other hand, was ready to sit through hundreds of hours of Russian literature just to escape the lieutenant’s oppressive stare."


translate english day_3_continue_fb52093d:


    "His brown eyes felt around the classroom, looking for me. Hair stood on the back of my neck, and an icicle had lodged in my gut."


translate english day_3_continue_47d56722:



    voice "voice/kate/93 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Is it true that Baburin got killed by a serial killer?"


translate english day_3_continue_9faa9385:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/06 E.ogg"
    Teacher "Shush, Ekaterina! Let the adults ask questions here."


translate english day_3_continue_d9502d19:



    voice "voice/kate/94 KA.ogg"
    Kate "We’re all scared."


translate english day_3_continue_c5c40ebf:



    voice "voice/kate/95 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Maybe the killer is somewhere close."


translate english day_3_continue_046b4f3e:



    voice "voice/kate/96 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Maybe they’re even sitting among us..."


translate english day_3_continue_e7d431ec:


    "Her sly stare was directed at me."


translate english day_3_continue_8f74996d:


    "Tikhonov stepped in between the rows of desks and started walking at an excruciatingly slow pace, brushing his fingers against the chairs he passed by."


translate english day_3_continue_e0d67ab5:


    "Some of the students almost broke their necks following his movements."


translate english day_3_continue_6870d412:


    "That’s how a crowd of commoners would gleefully anticipate a public execution in the middle ages."


translate english day_3_continue_c53d1491:


    "And he just walked, getting closer and closer to me."


translate english day_3_continue_8b5f4cce:


    "I gritted my teeth to stop myself from screaming."


translate english day_3_continue_049dcc9f:


    Ant_m "{i}Calm down, breathe!{/i}"


translate english day_3_continue_bb9f50f8:


    Ant_m "{i}You didn’t kill or kidnap anyone.{/i}"


translate english day_3_continue_03d0d3ff:


    "He already knew the answer to his question, but the policeman still asked in a stern voice:"


translate english day_3_continue_266abebd:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/22 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Anton Petrov?"


translate english day_3_continue_98f42b22:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/001.D.ogg"
    Ant "Yes."


translate english day_3_continue_81fd515a:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/07 V.ogg"
    Teacher "Stand up, Petrov."


translate english day_3_continue_aa37617a:


    "My muscles turned to stone. I got up, unglued myself from the chair. I felt like I could hear all my joints creak in the process."


translate english day_3_continue_006f05a9:


    "I only wished that Polina wouldn’t turn around and see the grimace of horror on my face."


translate english day_3_continue_e8efeea0:


    "If only I could be somewhere far away, in the forest, digging myself into a snow pile, rolling up into a ball there."


translate english day_3_continue_fe46d0f2:


    "The officer stared at me as if he was about to lock a pair of handcuffs on my wrists. I wonder how cold these bracelets are to the touch…"


translate english day_3_continue_44f96fba:


    "I imagined myself getting jailed, and put into a juvenile detention center, where tens of Semyons would constantly harass me."


translate english day_3_continue_cbedba12:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/002 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I don’t know anything. I have nothing to do with this."


translate english day_3_continue_643c9ba6:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/23 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Nobody is accusing you of anything..."


translate english day_3_continue_d244d028:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/24 P.ogg"
    Tikhonov "...for now."


translate english day_3_continue_8dda026d:


    "Only then I noticed a file that said “Case No. ” in his hand. It had a gray cover, made from rough carton."


translate english day_3_continue_42e9fb08:


    "It flopped onto the desk like a guillotine blade that slid down on someone’s neck."


translate english day_3_continue_8e499ac1:


    "With a measured motion, Tikhonov opened the file, still studying me with his gaze."


translate english day_3_continue_531d0e60:


    "I caught a glimpse of documents and photos. They showed prints on the snow. They looked like animal prints."


translate english day_3_continue_c27fc9f1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/25 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Have you talked to Semyon Baburin before?"


translate english day_3_continue_84ec3fe8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/004 N.ogg"
    Ant "I only knew him for a week."


translate english day_3_continue_08477504:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/003 od.ogg"
    Ant "I only knew him for a day."


translate english day_3_continue_4c648dd0:



    voice "voice/kate/97 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Everyone knows that Petrov hated him."


translate english day_3_continue_c0e3f91b:


    "I turned red."


translate english day_3_continue_43823f77:


    Ant_m "{i}You ugly bitch.{/i}"


translate english day_3_continue_4a40a557:


    "{i}I wanted to sink my teeth into Katya’s face and chew out her cheek.{/i}"


translate english day_3_continue_8012cf48:


    "Instead, I replied with the calmest voice I could muster:"


translate english day_3_continue_ead38bfe:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/006 Mi.ogg"
    Ant "We had a fight some time ago."


translate english day_3_continue_64f50be0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/007 On.ogg"
    Ant "He hit me."


translate english day_3_continue_f7717380:


    "A voice came from the side:"


translate english day_3_continue_a132e3d6:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/03 Xa.ogg"
    Rom "You’re fucked."


translate english day_3_continue_0414d9e8:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/08 Ta.ogg"
    Teacher "Hey, Pyatifanov, shut your mouth!"


translate english day_3_continue_c2f3945d:


    "I staggered, barely able to keep my balance."


translate english day_3_continue_ee240823:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/005 m.ogg"
    Ant "We had a fight yesterday."


translate english day_3_continue_35fcc291:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/008 NOon.ogg"
    Ant "But he started it."


translate english day_3_continue_b104bd27:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/009 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "So I hit him."


translate english day_3_continue_940568c3:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/26 S.ogg"
    Tikhonov "How hard did you hit him?"


translate english day_3_continue_62efdc80:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/010 D.ogg"
    Ant "Not that hard. I mean..."


translate english day_3_continue_5478d386:


    "I waved my hand indecisively."


translate english day_3_continue_ec549af5:


    "Tikhonov looked at my fist as if he was surprised that I managed to hit the big kid from the photo."


translate english day_3_continue_4fc2290e:


    "Surprisingly, Lilia Pavlovna came to my rescue."


translate english day_3_continue_a384c2e5:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/09 Ba.ogg"
    Teacher "Baburin is a troubled teen. A true pain in the rear."


translate english day_3_continue_1fc23bb7:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/10 S.ogg"
    Teacher "Always picking fights with other kids."


translate english day_3_continue_27776e8e:


    "The officer replied with a meaningful nod and fished out a notebook out of the file."


translate english day_3_continue_cd49a71f:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/27 A.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Is this yours?"


translate english day_3_continue_157cbabb:


    "I averted my gaze."


translate english day_3_continue_a02bd7d9:


    "It was a math notebook with my name on it."


translate english day_3_continue_6739d6d3:


    "My classmates devoured me greedily with their eyes. It felt like even the writers on the portraits squinted at me in suspicion."


translate english day_3_continue_f10d8d32:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/011M.ogg"
    Ant "Y-yes."


translate english day_3_continue_6fac90b0:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/28 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "We found it in the forest."


translate english day_3_continue_d65fd6ed:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/29 T.ogg"
    Tikhonov "In the area where the tractor driver, who was plowing snow there, last saw Baburin."


translate english day_3_continue_36629d6b:


    "I started blinking in bewilderment."


translate english day_3_continue_d7c9752c:


    "Romka ransacked my school bag. This notebook probably just got lost somewhere in the bushes."


translate english day_3_continue_ac11e9f4:


    "The lieutenant knew about the school brawl, but was he aware of the fight in the forest clearing?"


translate english day_3_continue_9a94fe76:


    "I had witnesses that could testify to Semyon and I walking in different directions after that."


translate english day_3_continue_e989b41c:


    "I looked toward the boys, hopeful."


translate english day_3_continue_8fe63a43:


