translate english day_3_continue_425ba6e3:


    "Romka swayed in his chair and gave me a thumbs up: \"Atta boy, good job keeping your trap shut.\""


translate english day_3_continue_995c643b:


    "I nodded, even though I didn’t feel a shred of pride from his praise."


