translate english day_3_continue_bbcd0105:


    "The gray file was left lying in front of me."


translate english day_3_continue_d5480dee:


    "I stared at it, my breathing so ragged that it I might’ve looked like someone who just ran a one-hundred-meter sprint."


translate english day_3_continue_41684f66:


