translate english minigame_folder_hit2_91cfe2df:


    "The officer started squeaking with a piece of chalk again, and I, after making sure nobody was watching me, opened the file and took out the photos that were hidden at the bottom."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_dae69cbf:


    "They reminded me of snapshots from that strange TV report."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_a9fcbdd8:


