translate english minigame_folder_hit2_3e1002cf:


    "My fingers trembled, and the photo glided through the air back into the file."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_427b3f60:


    "Thank God it landed upside-down. That steel box was just too unsettling to look at."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_54449127:


    "There was also a plastic bag at the bottom of the file, the type used to store evidence."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_9313ddcb:


    "I opened it..."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_c4bda52f:


