translate english minigame_folder_hit2_324adcca:


    "I blinked and the mirage dissolved."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_c5df4d10:


    "I couldn’t see a cut-off body part, there was only a signet ring inside."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_95be6de6:


    "Stunned by that fleeting hallucination, I almost felt like I was transported back to the forest and heard Semyon’s words."


translate english minigame_folder_hit2_d3e147da:



    voice "voice/semen/SCHa.ogg"
