    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/72 H.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Hm, and who might that be?"


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_82ee3f45:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/02 Lil.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Do you recognize this person, Lilia Pavlovna? Is this, by any chance, your arts and crafts teacher?"


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_c59ffa86:


    "My homeroom teacher squinted, trying to have a close look at my drawing."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_71d86a5a:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/18 Ka.ogg"
    Teacher "What a nasty mug."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_6655c2e7:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/75 Da.ogg"
    Bya "This must be Petrov’s old man! Ahaha!"


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_a7c74639:


    "Romka stopped Byasha’s thunderous laughter with a such a heavy slap across the back of the head that it made him bite his tongue."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_7f5e6620:


    "It felt like windows shuddered from all the surrounding laughter."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_58619b6d:



    voice "voice/lydia/3day/19 A.ogg"
    "Lilia Pavlovna hissed at the class and the commotion died down, but I was already burning at the stake of shame."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_933192e1:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/70 V.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Case closed, I guess."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_1a385482:


    "Tikhonov folded my drawing and threw it into the folder."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_49ac48e9:



    voice "voice/tihonov/3day/71 N.ogg"
    Tikhonov "Well, I’ll be going."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_f31c62c2:


    "He left."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_97e04774:


    "The bell rang."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_bb35fefa:



    voice "voice/kate/101 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Nutjob."


translate english day3_photo_trudovic_a8c0cb4c:


    "I didn’t move. Just kept staring into space."


translate english day3_draw_wrong_class_3e59494f:


    "Lilia Pavlovna passed by without looking my way. Polina left after her."


translate english day3_draw_wrong_class_5686b71b:


    "My classmates went silent at the same time as if someone muted the sound on a TV."


translate english day3_draw_wrong_class_af739e9a:


    "They followed me with their eyes the whole time I was passing between the rows."


translate english day3_draw_wrong_class_25b58945:


    "Judgmental looks. I felt like I was in the scopes of many sniper rifles."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_0a5a8278:


    "Lilia Pavlovna marched past, giving me a curious look."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_5686b71b:


    "My classmates went silent as if somebody lowered their volume using a remote."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_5e3ec9e4:


    "They followed me with their eyes the whole time I was passing between the rows, but something had changed about their gazes."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_0396394c:


    "Even Katya was different now."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_6a11bc8d:


    "I remembered vividly how my dad once stood up for a war vet during a bus ride, subduing a bunch of drunkards."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_5b07552b:


    "The other passengers back then had the same looks."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_4057a31f:


    "The looks of respect."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_00afbc3d:


    "After going to the restroom and washing my face in cold water, I returned to the classroom."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_3b92c100:


    "But as soon as I stepped through the doorway, somebody called my name in a cheerful voice."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_a5ad1ba1:


    "It was the girl sitting next to Katya."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_c9ae0ada:


    "She smiled and offered me a \"Skittles\" candy."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_df12e314:


    "I mumbled words of gratitude in reply and accidentally swallowed the small candy as if it was one of mom’s pills."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_8a9b8cf2:


    "A happy shout came from the side."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_3773f766:


    Classmate "Anton, can you draw me?"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_a4f7faa3:


    Classmate "And me! Draw me, too!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_0a2b7f07:


    "The shouts were coming from all directions now, so I pushed my back to the atlas hanging on the wall, embarrassed."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_86ff5273:


    Classmate "Did you learn this by yourself?"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_f11a430b:


    Classmate "Can you draw Van Damme? I’ll hang it up in my room like a poster!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_b7a6158b:



    voice "voice/kate/102 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Hey, I was the first to ask him!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_8fc440e0:


    "Katya slithered up to me like a venomous snake, inserting herself between me and my classmates."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_2af12e86:



    voice "voice/kate/103 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Anton has already promised to draw me. As a sign of friendship..."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_25399a31:



    voice "voice/kate/104 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Yes, yes, yes!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_6aa92411:



    voice "voice/kate/105 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Tell them, Anton!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_ec0fbd7d:


    "\"Yeah right!\" a thought flashed through my mind."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_ca649212:


    "As soon as I showed some promise, Katya immediately decided to befriend me."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_50e33216:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/027 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, but I already promised someone else."


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_6dd07138:


    "I saw Katya’s face contort slightly, but she didn’t say anything back."


translate english day3_transit_wrong_fox_bd1c0905:


    "I rushed to squeeze myself through the laughing classmates, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_wrong_fox_64fa5170:


    "I squeezed through the barricade made of desks, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_witness_fox_bd1c0905:


    "I rushed to squeeze myself through the laughing classmates, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_witness_fox_64fa5170:


    "I squeezed through the barricade made of desks, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_wrong_notfox_bd1c0905:


    "I rushed to squeeze myself through the laughing classmates, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_wrong_notfox_64fa5170:


    "I squeezed through the barricade made of desks, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_witness_notfox_bd1c0905:


    "I rushed to squeeze myself through the laughing classmates, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_transit_witness_notfox_64fa5170:


    "I squeezed through the barricade made of desks, looking for Polina…"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_5f7fd598:


    "...but I stumbled into my new \"buddies\", instead."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_c02cb532:


    "Romka swaggered up to me."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_f158495a:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/04 Re.ogg"
    Rom "Decided to rat us out to the cops?"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_da86ae60:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/025 No.ogg"
    Ant "I didn’t say anything."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_011f0ccd:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/77 Zato.ogg"
    Bya "But sure as fuck thought about it, eh."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_a9c33ee1:


    "Romka towered over me, breathing out a faint smell of tobacco."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_6d8fbc59:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/05 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "You’re very wrong if you think that without Syoma you’ll have a better time here."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_c57e641e:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/06 M.ogg"
    Rom "You can stop your weird act, trying to impress Polina with your doodles or by acting like a loony."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_1d53904c:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/07 mi.ogg"
    Rom "We’ll make this place hell for you, got it?"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_222027e8:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/08 Do.ogg"
    Rom "See you, four-eyes!"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_912baf39:


    "My head tilted forward from his slap."


translate english day3_draw_notfox_5c12b84f:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/78 Vot.ogg"
    Bya "What a loser, eh!"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_02d1649b:


    "I wasn’t surprised to find a note stuck to my back during the break. It said:"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_d8b86e34:


    "KICK ME!"


translate english day3_draw_notfox_14a82f11:


    "My nightmare clearly wasn’t about to end."


translate english day3_draw_fox_e268d836:


    "...but instead I stumbled into my new buddies."


translate english day3_draw_fox_b344ba2c:


    "Romka and Byasha were waiting for me at the notice board."


translate english day3_draw_fox_e3f190a0:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/09 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "I was right about you, Toshik."


translate english day3_draw_fox_e1d70d3c:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/10 Pa.ogg"
    Rom "Atta boy! You didn’t rat us out. You know, us roughing up Porky."


translate english day3_draw_fox_1a3ef2cf:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/028 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "This would’ve given the police a false lead."


translate english day3_draw_fox_0c4a3634:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/028 Na.ogg"
    Ant "I think..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_6c36f803:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/029 A.ogg"
    Ant "Are you sure you have nothing to do with Por… Semyon’s disappearance?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_3d10c588:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/11 M.ogg"
    Rom "No, but what about you?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_e4db2e0b:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/12 Po.ogg"
    Rom "Remember how you bailed out on us in the darkness?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_62205c80:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/79 A.ogg"
    Bya "Yeah! I was, like, this four-eyes is a beast."


translate english day3_draw_fox_3ed84c1b:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/80 Sh.ogg"
    Bya "Will catch up with the fatso and end him, eh!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_cfb5a8cd:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/13 baz.ogg"
    Rom "What he said!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_87bd7d11:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/14 Od.ogg"
    Rom "But we believe you. Works both ways, right?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_cc26a277:


    "Romka’s stern look made me uncomfortable, so I nodded."


translate english day3_draw_fox_3d89ddf4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/15 Vo.ogg"
    Rom "Good to hear."


translate english day3_draw_fox_507e3864:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/81 Et.ogg"
    Bya "Hey... Anton, where did you learn to draw so cool?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_14af39f8:


    "I got flustered, but tried not to show it. I picked at the floor with my boot, instead. "


translate english day3_draw_fox_d79acc1d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/030 Da.ogg"
    Ant "Well, you know, I just could do it since I was little."


translate english day3_draw_fox_2d49b15b:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/82 K.ogg"
    Bya "Cool shit! I’m also, you know... an artist."


translate english day3_draw_fox_9d06e115:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/84 Pa.ogg"
    Bya "Can burn pictures into wood with a soldering tool, eh."


translate english day3_draw_fox_7b9199f6:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/85 Von.ogg"
    Bya "Burnt a tulip for my old woman’s birthday on her cutting board."


translate english day3_draw_fox_cdcc38b1:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/86 V.ogg"
    Bya "I mean, it’s cool that we know each other."


translate english day3_draw_fox_b746de6a:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/16 T.ogg"
    Rom "Look, just don’t get all cuddly here, okay?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_e023f3e4:


    "Romka lowered his voice and looked around the corridor in suspicion."


translate english day3_draw_fox_942a5fea:


    "The other kids were stealing glances at us, whispering."


translate english day3_draw_fox_cb4dd344:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/17 Sh.ogg"
    Rom "So, Syoma is missing, that’s a fact."


translate english day3_draw_fox_717c814f:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/18 K.ogg"
    Rom "Not just missing, but most likely already dead."


translate english day3_draw_fox_a6add373:



    voice "voice/byasha/64 Otshat.ogg"
    "Byasha shuddered."


translate english day3_draw_fox_8ad33688:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/031 A.ogg"
    Ant "How do you know that?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_562d3a99:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/19 D.ogg"
    Rom "Because…!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_96cdf64b:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/29 M.ogg"
    Rom "We already talked about this. It’s not the first time this had happened."


translate english day3_draw_fox_996afcbc:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/30 D.ogg"
    Rom "Think Senechka, Vova and Syoma went to Narnia?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_9f222d41:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/31 P.ogg"
    Rom "And they’ll return from the forest after hanging out there, sucking on some candy?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_506511b4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/32 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "It’s clear who got them."


translate english day3_draw_fox_20f02d1d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/032 N.ogg"
    Ant "Can it be the black..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_d93b1d70:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/87 Ma.ogg"
    Bya "The serial killer!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_68ffcc6c:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/89 Mne.ogg"
    Bya "An old man from mom’s work told me that he also saw the Harelip in the village."


translate english day3_draw_fox_2ae7a9d0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/033 V.ogg"
    Ant "If only we could find out who he is."


translate english day3_draw_fox_ac2af4c5:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/33 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Well, if that killer offed Baburin, he’ll come after us, too."


translate english day3_draw_fox_20da0b8f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/034 S.ogg"
    Ant "Listen, while Tikhonov was giving his lecture, I snuck a peek at his files."


translate english day3_draw_fox_b9d7f0da:


    "Byasha whistled."


translate english day3_draw_fox_cbe188b2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/035 T.ogg"
    Ant "There was an item there... A signet ring."


translate english day3_draw_fox_08873c02:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/036 S.ogg"
    Ant "The one Syoma wore. And I, um… snatched it."


translate english day3_draw_fox_3c14c43d:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/90 Da.ogg"
    Bya "No way! Show us!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_812ead4c:


    "I looked around like a thief, then carefully took out the stolen ring."


translate english day3_draw_fox_3b6c8691:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/92 T.ogg"
    Bya "Jus’ like I thought, eh! The killer got him."


translate english day3_draw_fox_f4b36d9a:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/93 Na.ogg"
    Bya "He’ll cut us to pieces, too."


translate english day3_draw_fox_8eb1f658:


    "Roma wasn’t impressed by that information. He just nodded, looking grim."


translate english day3_draw_fox_c8c6d8c8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/037 A.ogg"
    Ant "There also was a photo... with a garage. A black one."


translate english day3_draw_fox_fb76289d:


    "Byasha looked like he was punched in the gut. He staggered and hid his face in his hands."


translate english day3_draw_fox_78ded07b:


    "Romka rolled his eyes and swore."


translate english day3_draw_fox_8662809a:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/34 O.ogg"
    Rom "Not this again."


translate english day3_draw_fox_65184e46:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/35 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Calm down, bro, chill."


translate english day3_draw_fox_b89faa0a:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/038 B.ogg"
    Ant "Byasha, you’ve encountered the Black Garage before, right?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_f205637d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/038 R.ogg"
    Ant "Roma said that you even took a look inside."


translate english day3_draw_fox_49010965:


    "The Buryat kid started shaking all over, as if he was thrown outside naked in the middle of winter, and every new question was like a bucket of cold water on top of that."


translate english day3_draw_fox_3069eeec:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/039 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "What did you see there?"


translate english day3_draw_fox_76608aac:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/97 Bee А.ogg"
    Bya "Blee-blee-blee..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_bb3e7275:


    "Romka shielded his friend with his chest, clearly upset by my interrogation."


translate english day3_draw_fox_bbc18f08:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/36 Za.ogg"
    Rom "Forget it! He won’t say shit now."


translate english day3_draw_fox_122e27ce:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/37 B.ogg"
    Rom "Byasha’s brain breaks every time someone mentions this."


translate english day3_draw_fox_e40dc1ca:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/38 K.ogg"
    Rom "Since you’re with us now, I’ll tell you this once..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_d89856a0:


    "Romka leaned in, like we were some sort of co-conspirators, winced in disgust as if reluctant to relieve the memory, and spoke in a whisper."


translate english day3_draw_fox_deda0fdd:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/39 O.ogg"
    Rom "We were bored as hell last autumn so we decided to play with black magic. You know, summoning the Queen of Spades or making fun of Pushkin’s spirit, the usual stuff."


translate english day3_draw_fox_ac2e03c2:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/40 A.ogg"
    Rom "But the result wasn’t fun at all, bro."


translate english day3_draw_fox_a9c3bb44:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/41 O.ogg"
    Rom "One old loon told us that we might summon a real ghost if we break the one great taboo of our parents."


translate english day3_draw_fox_17d04ac7:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/42 Ch.ogg"
    Rom "Shit, I already knew he was bonkers back then..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_aba4f7dd:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/43 V.ogg"
    Rom "We only needed to go behind that row of garages late at night..."


translate english day3_draw_fox_218754cc:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/44 E.ogg"
    Rom "...and knock on the fucking black one."


translate english day3_draw_fox_a3e6fa3e:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/45 Ta.ogg"
    Rom "That would make some black shit appear and take all the kids into a better world. What a fucking story!"


translate english day3_draw_fox_4378d672:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/46 Vo.ogg"
    Rom "So we decided to take the bait, as a joke."


translate english day3_draw_fox_cd063b61:


    "Byasha wrapped his hand around his head and let out a lengthy bleat."


translate english day3_draw_fox_61246a2e:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/97 be.ogg"
    Bya "Bleeeeeat."


translate english day3_draw_fox_55421c27:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/48 A.ogg"
    Rom "And when Byasha was doing the bravery test, he needed to knock on that garage, but the bastard took a peek inside, instead."


translate english day3_draw_fox_f66433e4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/50 E.ogg"
    Rom "Maybe it was the right thing to do."


translate english day3_draw_fox_9824f3a3:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/51 On.ogg"
    Rom "He screamed so hard, tears sprayed from his eyes."


translate english day3_draw_fox_747b09f8:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/52 Ot.ogg"
    Rom "I tell you, I’ve never seen somebody this hysterical."


translate english day3_draw_fox_b1202bfb:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/53 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "Clearly, inside of it wasn’t the promised land."


translate english day3_draw_fox_6ce97580:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/54 S.ogg"
    Rom "Since that day, the Black Garage has been snooping around our alleyways, gobbling up good fellas."


translate english day3_suefa_2effae3d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/040 Chto.ogg"
    Ant "What do we do now?"


translate english day3_suefa_939aa76d:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/55 V.ogg"
    Rom "Stay together, that’s what. The three of us are like {u}Voltron{/u}."


translate english day3_suefa_44528941:


    "Byasha, who suddenly woke up from his shock, mumbled:"


translate english day3_suefa_65e597c7:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/98 Eto.ogg"
    Bya "Um..."


translate english day3_suefa_09f31088:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/99 V.ogg"
    Bya "There were five of them in Voltron, eh."


translate english day3_suefa_0c332d98:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/56 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Well, we’re an injured Voltron, then."


translate english day3_suefa_6fe9b509:


    "He looked at me with an adult gaze and nodded. His eyes were full of worry and sadness."


translate english day3_suefa_4d8d110a:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/57 La.ogg"
    Rom "Whatever, since Syoma is no longer with us... Let’s go!"


translate english day3_suefa_a60f5ca6:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/58 D.ogg"
    Rom "We have a job to do. You’ll keep watch for us. Everybody seems to be scared shitless of you."


translate english day3_suefa_39b9f0d4:


    "Scared shitless? Of me?"


translate english day3_suefa_93f330e4:


    "While I still couldn’t wrap all that around my head, their attitude softened me up and I agreed on the spot."


translate english day3_suefa_84031f32:


    "I followed Romka and Byasha through the twilight corridors of our school, savoring my newfound brazenness."


translate english day3_suefa_68c9d36c:


    "We walked pompously, like heroes of some criminal drama."


translate english day3_suefa_0a7d8871:


    "As if the three of us had access to some knowledge, hidden from everybody else."


translate english day3_suefa_acd464d8:


    "I’m not sure I would’ve gone with them if they told me what the goal of our campaign was."


translate english day3_suefa_00cf44f0:


    "We hid in the darkness near the school gym, and my companions started rubbing their knuckles, watching boys leave the dressing room."


translate english day3_suefa_ef2c479f:


    "Finally, Byasha pointed at someone inside the crowd."


translate english day3_suefa_8b5be5a6:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/100 Vo.ogg"
    Bya "Here’s that sucker!"


translate english day3_suefa_690a1642:


    "Romka smiled dangerously and proclaimed in a low voice:"


translate english day3_suefa_16210ca8:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/59 S.ogg"
    Rom "Keep watch. If you see a teacher, let us know."


translate english day3_suefa_5e047216:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/101 G.ogg"
    Bya "Watch will all four eyes, eh."


translate english day3_suefa_0ebf394d:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/60 Davai.ogg"
    "I stood at the corner, filled with conflicting feelings and thoughts."


translate english day3_suefa_fe40110a:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/60 Nono.ogg"
    "In a cul-de-sac behind me, Romka was having a back-and-forth with some fifth grader."


translate english day3_suefa_54461ec3:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/60 Schet.ogg"
    "The boy was protesting on the verge of tears, but Romka stood his ground, spewing countless obscenities at him, with Byasha occasionally adding a couple of word of his own."


translate english day3_suefa_1d02d079:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/30 Cry.ogg"
    "Would dad praise me for involving myself with this?"


translate english day3_suefa_cad86628:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/61 v.ogg"
    Rom "Alright, now scram."


translate english day3_suefa_c8d6a577:


    "My new friends came out of the cul-de-sac."


translate english day3_suefa_b24cf588:


    "A lightbulb illuminated the camera in Romka’s hands."


translate english day3_suefa_d166b24f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/041 Og.ogg"
    Ant "Wow! A Polaroid... Is it yours?"


translate english day3_suefa_34608943:


    "Romka shook the black electronics marvel with a retractable flash, disinterested."


translate english day3_suefa_5e69feea:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/62 Te.ogg"
    Rom "It is now."


translate english day3_suefa_be200e59:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/63 M.ogg"
    Rom "There was this guy who owed me a bike for talking shit."


translate english day3_suefa_43f667f5:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/64 N.ogg"
    Rom "Turned out he didn’t have one."


translate english day3_suefa_fb16fb04:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/65 V.ogg"
    Rom "So he paid with the cam."


translate english day3_suefa_8d9fcbdf:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/66 A.ogg"
    Rom "And I have jack shit use for it."


translate english day3_suefa_e4b62a14:


    "I felt bad for that boy, but all the negative thoughts disappeared when I looked at the treasured camera."


translate english day3_suefa_64ab74d7:


    "I could clearly imagine how happy Olya would be with this Polaroid. I imagined myself taking pictures of my sister, dad, and mom. "


translate english day3_suefa_edcea9c6:


    "The faces of my family would gradually appear on the hard paper as if emerging from the dissolving mist."


translate english day3_suefa_3b9f4bc6:


    "I’d take pictures of Polina, too. That way, I’d be able to get her photo for myself."


translate english day3_suefa_dda74a63:


    "I’d keep it in my desk. Under lock and key."


translate english day3_suefa_86d53139:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/042.Ra.ogg"
    Ant "If you don’t need it, can I get it?"


translate english day3_suefa_7cb3488c:


    "Roma measured me with a sharp glare, turning into the Romka I’d met yesterday."


translate english day3_suefa_22660c74:


    "The callous leader of a carnivorous pack."


translate english day3_suefa_ac090bcd:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/67 T.ogg"
    Rom "Sorry, bro, but I don’t throw away things like that."


translate english day3_suefa_e9504dc6:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/68 M.ogg"
    Rom "I can drop it at a pawn shop, or bet it on some game."


translate english day3_suefa_f11e9a56:


    "For some reason, as soon as he mentioned a game, I remembered Alisa. "


translate english day3_suefa_44e732fb:


    "I looked at the Polaroid."


translate english day3_suefa_6673fbb1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/043 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Well, let’s play for it, then. Do you have a game in mind?"


translate english day3_suefa_91096b51:


    "Byasha snickered into his fist."


translate english day3_suefa_9e094967:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/108 Che.ogg"
    Bya "Yo, Romka, shall we make Antoshka lose his shirt?"


translate english day3_suefa_17db49a4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/69 Ya.ogg"
    Rom "Do I look like someone who'd strip another dude to you?"


translate english day3_suefa_efac7a8c:


    "Romka stared at me from above."


translate english day3_suefa_7ec7845d:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/70 N.ogg"
    Rom "What do you have to bet?"


translate english day3_suefa_abeb7886:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/71 U.ogg"
    Rom "Do you even have cash?"


translate english day3_suefa_a4408478:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/110 Vo.ogg"
    Bya "That’s right! What’s in ya pockets, Toshik?"


translate english day3_suefa_817a3f63:


    "I slowly turned the pockets of my pants inside-out, in wane hopes of salvaging at least some change from my lunch money..."


translate english day3_suefa_6a6bf768:


    "Among the pocket dust were a couple of copper coins, a button and a half-used rubber eraser."


translate english day3_suefa_557fc850:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/72 P.ogg"
    Rom "Sorry, bro."


translate english day3_suefa_89626e81:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/73 N.ogg"
    Rom "This pile of treasure won’t do."


translate english day3_suefa_b1ff7556:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/74 A.ogg"
    Rom "And no bet means no game."


translate english day3_suefa_20e496ab:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/75 D.ogg"
    Rom "Let’s do it some other time."


translate english day3_suefa_f5663c64:


    "Romka hanged the Polaroid around his neck and winked at us."


translate english day3_suefa_945b599e:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/76 N.ogg"
    Rom "Alright, boys, let’s go pick up some chicks?"


translate english day3_suefa_1d639e26:


    "Something rustled in my pocket."


translate english day3_suefa_cc6994e4:


    "I fished out the Mercedes-Benz insert I got thanks to Alisa."


translate english day3_suefa_ee235025:


    "I guess I shoved it there without thinking when it flew out of my school bag with all the notebooks."


translate english day3_suefa_607bde9e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/044.Ana.ogg"
    Ant "Will you play for this insert?"


translate english day3_suefa_73207e60:


    "Byasha’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets as soon as I brought the car’s picture closer, but Romka didn’t move a muscle."


translate english day3_suefa_74689fc0:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/77 H.ogg"
    Rom "Want me to bet a whole cam for some insert?"


translate english day3_suefa_557044c2:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/114 E.ogg"
    Bya "That’s..."


translate english day3_suefa_3e513a93:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/78 Da.ogg"
    Rom "The gum is worth one ruble, and this Polariod has a fresh cartridge inside."


translate english day3_suefa_8d0b4c73:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/114 Et.ogg"
    Bya "Look, that’s..."


translate english day3_suefa_fe8cf318:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/79 O.ogg"
    Rom "I have a shit ton of inserts like that. Why would I want… "


translate english day3_suefa_c9e08283:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/115 M.ogg"
    Bya "Mercedes-Benz, eh! The one we’re still missing, Romka!"


translate english day3_suefa_e8e9ee53:


    "Romka spit on the ground and slapped Byasha over the back of the head."


translate english day3_suefa_018262af:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/81 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Why can’t you keep your mouth shut? Now he’ll jack up the price."


translate english day3_suefa_fabbf30f:


    "Just like I suspected, this automobile was a valuable addition for every Turbo gum collector."


translate english day3_suefa_a2b6896d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/045.Aga.ogg"
    Ant "A-ha, so this caught your eye, after all?"


translate english day3_suefa_ad6a8b7c:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/046.Ta.ogg"
    Ant "What are we going to play?"


translate english day3_suefa_4f7c7f5e:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/117 V.ogg"
    Bya "Siege durak?"


translate english day3_suefa_28a56e2e:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/82 V.ogg"
    Rom "Mumblety-peg?"


translate english day3_suefa_67b16daf:


    "In the blink of an eye, a greasy deck of most likely marked cards appeared in Byasha’s hands, and Romka masterfully swung his butterfly knife like in front of my nose."


translate english day3_suefa_f907da74:


    "I had no desire to play by their rules."


translate english day3_suefa_886f3e16:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/047 A.ogg"
    Ant "Let’s play rock, paper, scissors."


translate english day3_suefa_2f153c75:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/83 O.ogg"
    Rom "Oh, I see you’re a gambler."


translate english day3_suefa_82011ae4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/84 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Alright, my Polaroid against your Mercedes?"


translate english day3_suefa_8a9adf4a:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/048 Po.ogg"
    Ant "Deal."


translate english suefa_lose_0230524e:


    "Byahsa started clapping so hard that the kids walking through the corridor gave us weird looks."


translate english suefa_lose_3991f3ec:


    "I was completely defeated."


translate english suefa_lose_48398744:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/122 F.ogg"
    Bya "Finicular comedia, Toshik! Gimme that, eh."


translate english suefa_lose_5f1fe322:


    "My only proof of Alisa’s existence traveled to Romka through Byasha’s hands."


translate english suefa_lose_7cc1fedd:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/92 A.ogg"
    Rom "Here it is! The jewel of my collection."


translate english suefa_lose_0d8724a3:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/93 S.ogg"
    Rom "Thanks, Tosha, was a pleasure dealing with you."


translate english suefa_win_86b2dc1c:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/052.Viig.ogg"
    Ant "So, do I win now? Or do I need to beat Byasha, too?"


translate english suefa_win_d8c8306c:


    "Romka mumbled something under his breath."


translate english suefa_win_431d77ac:


    "He’d probably refuse to play by the rules, and I’ll be left with nothing."


translate english suefa_win_63e5857b:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/124 E.ogg"
    Bya "Hey, Romka, he won fair’n’square, eh."


translate english suefa_win_7470762a:


    "Romka reluctantly gave up."


translate english suefa_win_1e4a7fb5:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/95 V.ogg"
    Rom "You’re one lucky bastard. Here!"


translate english suefa_win_8280cfd7:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/96 T.ogg"
    Rom "Just don’t take pictures of your wiener."


translate english suefa_win_fe73ea8e:


    "I weighed the Polaroid on my palms and realized that I was smirking. Like a true winner."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_89cbaa24:


    "It’s been seven days since the lieutenant visited our class."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_2e1f9a27:


    "At first glance, everything was still the same."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_ae8b5578:


    "The forest still held out its gnarly claws toward the village, and the wind whipped up white flags weaved from powdery snow every night."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_085bf04c:


    "When my parents argued in the other room, I would turn up the TV’s volume to silence their muffled voices and sit close to Olya."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_81f07fa2:


    "Vova’s and Semyon’s photos were still two black spots on the notice board, and round-faced Senya hasn’t returned home, too."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_a63d26aa:


    "Vova’s and Semyon’s photos were still two black spots on the notice board."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_24353978:


    "But something did change. I could see how different the looks of my classmates were."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_5f08d5cd:


    "They met me with a new portion of pokes and insults. Contempt, mockery and loneliness became my faithful companions."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_ba89e478:


    "They made my pockets bulge with gifted apples. Their animosity was gone. School wasn’t scary anymore."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_1a2ca336:


    "But most importantly..."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_c714843c:


    "A shadow slid across my desk, leaving behind a mysterious note."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_e4be60dd:


    "I glanced into the space between rows, but the messenger was already nowhere to be found."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_19eabedc:


    "Who sent me this note? What could this carefully ripped-out and neatly folded piece of paper be hiding from me?"


translate english dev_day3_week_end_03f29a04:


    "More threats and humiliation, or… "


translate english dev_day3_week_end_9ebcb98a:


    "I took the piece of paper and carefully inhaled the wafting aroma."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_42387107:


    "Blackberry."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_039a9db6:


    "Inside was a message in beautiful handwriting: \"I’m waiting at a dead end near the dressing room. Come alone.\""


translate english dev_day3_week_end_70a53e56:


    "Drunk on that sudden call, I immediately started walking, looking over my shoulder from time to time, making sure nobody is following me."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_2aba4024:


    "Even though I suspected it could be another trap set up by Romka and Byasha at first, this buzzing thought soon left my mind."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_76e73391:


    "The two of them didn’t have enough combined brainpower to fake Polina’s note so carefully."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_35c603f1:


    "I didn’t even notice how I almost broke into a run and jumped around the corner."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_f3545699:


    "As soon as I did that, I rammed into somebody inside the dark nook."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_b8262865:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/01 O.ogg"
    Pol "Ow!"


translate english dev_day3_week_end_e4e95e7a:


    "Like a magic bird, a green notebook glided to my feet. "


translate english dev_day3_week_end_c1e50c61:


    "Polina puffed her cheeks in exaggerated anger."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_18d4d800:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/02 P.ogg"
    Pol "Petrov, have you lost your sight completely?"


translate english dev_day3_week_end_20c5893d:


    "I fixed my glasses; my nearsightedness wasn’t that embarrassing anymore."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_cef9b154:


    "I bent down and picked up the notebook."


translate english dev_day3_week_end_a4a5c4ad:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/054 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, I was in a rush. Were you waiting for me? Did something happen?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_668394f4:


    "Polina’s attitude changed from fake anger to softness, she stood there silent, probably picking out the right words."


translate english day3_amulet_before_d44fed01:


    "She had a worried and sad look in her eyes as if she hoped that I’d continue this conversation and stop us from drowning in this awkward silence."


translate english day3_amulet_before_227a95fa:


    "But I didn’t say a word, I was just staring at her trembling lips."


translate english day3_amulet_before_7d58b206:


    "Finally, Polina heaved a deep sigh and started talking meekly:"


translate english day3_amulet_before_87ba380f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/03 N.ogg"
    Pol "About yesterday…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_df254e32:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/04 A.ogg"
    Pol "Anton, tell me, are you mad at me?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_ded77cee:


    "I couldn’t reply before she continued."


translate english day3_amulet_before_fd37eb8b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/05 Oh.ogg"
    Pol "Of course, you are. What’s with this stupid question?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_208b1059:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/06 P.ogg"
    Pol "I’m so sorry, I didn’t mean for that to happen, honest!"


translate english day3_amulet_before_e5291523:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/07 Ko.ogg"
    Pol "When Pyatifanov… When that abuser kicked the doggy…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_4625a7df:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/08 Et.ogg"
    Pol "It felt like I wasn’t myself, you know?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_1d4e870a:


    "She sniffed, and even though it was already quite dark outside, I could notice her ocean-colored eyes sparkle."


translate english day3_amulet_before_c656cd09:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/09 Da.ogg"
    Pol "I know that it’s wrong…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_0383dcbe:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/10 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "It’s wrong laughing at animal abuse."


translate english day3_amulet_before_b6288ad5:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/11 Nez.ogg"
    Pol "I don’t even want to think what your opinion of me must be…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_6d16e30a:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/12 No.ogg"
    Pol "But I just can’t help it, Anton."


translate english day3_amulet_before_a1e585d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/13 S.ogg"
    Pol "As soon as I remember grandpa and the horrors he had to endure on the night when he got attacked by that pack of stray dogs…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_38426ae2:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/14 K.ogg"
    Pol "My mind becomes foggy."


translate english day3_amulet_before_fc14c203:


    "Polina’s notebook in my hand was still waiting for me to return it to its rightful owner, but I just couldn’t find the right moment to do that."


translate english day3_amulet_before_de05be8b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/15 T.ogg"
    Pol "You probably think I’m crazy, right?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_ec6ee115:


    "She looked at me with hopeful eyes, while I was absentmindedly going over all the crazy stuff that my subconscious was producing lately."


translate english day3_amulet_before_8830703e:


    "I clearly wasn’t qualified to judge someone’s sanity."


translate english day3_amulet_before_b3458b4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/16 M.ogg"
    Pol "Sometimes I just can’t control of myself. "


translate english day3_amulet_before_09e563da:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/17 No.ogg"
    Pol "But I’d never harm anyone, you hear?!"


translate english day3_amulet_before_32ec3fae:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/18 N.ogg"
    Pol "Not like that sadist, Romka."


translate english day3_amulet_before_a652539f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/19 A.ogg"
    Pol "Please, stay away from him, Anton!"


translate english day3_amulet_before_f6178b49:


    "Something clicked in my head. I stared at Polina with suspicion."


translate english day3_amulet_before_6646a146:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/58 V.ogg"
    Ant "You called him differently a week ago, when we were fighting."


translate english day3_amulet_before_5fb18fdf:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/58 R.ogg"
    Ant "Romochka."


translate english day3_amulet_before_932cddcc:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/59 Sk.ogg"
    Ant "Say, are you two dating?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_478e3b4e:


    "Polina jolted as if struck by lightning."


translate english day3_amulet_before_6b7eb97e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/20 E.ogg"
    Pol "No way! That asshole is stuck to me like a leech."


translate english day3_amulet_before_7b54b872:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/22 T.ogg"
    Pol "People like him are not even deterred by direct insults."


translate english day3_amulet_before_c13b528d:


    "Her voice became calmer when she noticed the bruises and cuts on my face."


translate english day3_amulet_before_f20eaa60:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/23 P.ogg"
    Pol "Again, I’m very sorry that happened."


translate english day3_amulet_before_cc239486:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/24 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I… Well, I really thought I would be able to help you yesterday."


translate english day3_amulet_before_de9c531f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/25 Z.ogg"
    Pol "It was my mistake to think that bastards like them can have any sort of moral code."


translate english day3_amulet_before_7fde70d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/26 V.ogg"
    Pol "Here, I have a present for you."


translate english day3_amulet_before_1904fa4b:


    "She unbuttoned the top of her jacket and instantly got embarrassed after noticing my stunned look. "


translate english day3_amulet_before_aa0fdb1d:


    "Then she took an amulet on a thick leather thread with a big animal claw off her neck and held it out to me."


translate english day3_amulet_before_09760c86:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/28 E.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa gifted me this charm. "


translate english day3_amulet_before_c8127670:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/29 G.ogg"
    Pol "He said that it helps against crazy and possessed."


translate english day3_amulet_before_5a6693de:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/30 On.ogg"
    Pol "He got him from a certain shaman..."


translate english day3_amulet_before_fdeaacfc:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/31M.ogg"
    Pol "You don’t have to believe me, but the tragedy that befell him happened on the only day when he forgot to wear it."


translate english day3_amulet_before_f80bca25:


    "I snuck another glance at the intensely scratched claw of an unknown beast."


translate english day3_amulet_before_ff0cac13:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/60 A.ogg"
    Ant "And who did it belong to? The claw, I mean."


translate english day3_amulet_before_6a73ead3:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/32 D.ogg"
    Pol "I don’t know…"


translate english day3_amulet_before_046333a7:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/33 M.ogg"
    Pol "A bear, or a tiger, maybe?"


translate english day3_amulet_before_7354033f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/34 K.ogg"
    Pol "You can find all sorts of animals in our forest."


translate english day3_amulet_before_69687a22:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/35 V.ogg"
    Pol "Anyway, please accept it along with my sincere apology."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_93fc9bd0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/61 E.ogg"
    Ant "Well, this is so important for you..."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_af10671b:


    "I carefully took hold of the amulet with my free hand. It emanated Polina’s warmth and the charming aroma of blackberry. "


translate english day3_amulet_yes_4e92af6a:


    "I hung it around my neck and hid it under the collar of my shirt."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_e8a622b2:


    "Along with this gift, I got a weird feeling of determination as if this amulet would be able to change my life."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_e973dcf3:


    "Polina and I smiled at the same time, both of us feeling the ice wall between us slowly thaw."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_8627d6e3:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/36 S.ogg"
    Pol "Thank you, Anton."


translate english day3_amulet_yes_b648586e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/37 D.ogg"
    Pol "This really means a lot to me."


translate english day3_amulet_no_bc8f2f3e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/62 Da.ogg"
    Ant "I’ll let you keep it."


translate english day3_amulet_no_2e5c328f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/63 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "This is your family relic, after all…"


translate english day3_amulet_no_a6aa4596:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/64 Da.ogg"
    Ant "And I’ll feel calmer knowing that you’re under protection."


translate english day3_amulet_no_3ed35aa2:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/38 V.ogg"
    Pol "You’re always thinking about others..."


translate english day3_amulet_no_215cf8d0:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/39 Z.ogg"
    Pol "You know, I thought chivalry was exclusive to books."


translate english day3_amulet_no_198e6fc2:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/40 P.ogg"
    Pol "Until I met you."


translate english day3_amulet_no_f7f51b2e:


    "I felt a bit embarrassed, so I started shuffling my feet: "


translate english day3_amulet_no_166635fd:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/65 S.ogg"
    Ant "That’s a big overstatement."


translate english day3_amulet_no_ec5e4531:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/41 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I’m serious!"


translate english day3_amulet_no_9807a448:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/42 A.ogg"
    Pol "And what about my apology? Will you accept it?"


translate english day3_amulet_no_dc75a1e7:


    "Polina flashed me a charming smile, looking me straight in the eye. I turned even redder. "


translate english day3_amulet_no_35a45a00:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/66 Da.ogg"
    Ant "I wasn’t even that mad at you from the beginning."


translate english day3_amulet_after_5d897d87:


    "Polina studied me with her eyes and clicked her tongue."


translate english day3_amulet_after_1cf1ff52:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/03 A.ogg"
    Pol "Do you know what you look like, Antosha?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english day3_amulet_after_491ef6b3:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/04 Na.ogg"
    Pol "Like blues improv."


translate english day3_amulet_after_0ba124ec:


    "I blinked in bewilderment."


translate english day3_amulet_after_86c6fc25:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/055 Eto.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_37c7afd0:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/05 D.ogg"
    Pol "I always associate people I know with something."


translate english day3_amulet_after_2efc4eb1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/056..ogg"
    Ant "I do that, too. But why music?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_9cafe419:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/06 Vo.ogg"
    Pol "It can’t be anything other than music!"


translate english day3_amulet_after_8f02e323:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/07 B.ogg"
    Pol "Some people are like guitar solos. Some are drums. People like our Lilia Pavlovna are war marches."


translate english day3_amulet_after_6877d187:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/08 A.ogg"
    Pol "And you’re so thoughtful, so mysterious. Sometimes even a bit sad."


translate english day3_amulet_after_73b1cda1:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/09 T.ogg"
    Pol "You’re definitely blues."


translate english day3_amulet_after_c68636e1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/057 A.ogg"
    Ant "And what about the improv part?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_fa868b83:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/10 A.ogg"
    Pol "It’s when the listener has no idea where the melody will go, what tempo it will adopt."


translate english day3_amulet_after_17a9e0e9:


    "Of course, some of the things Polina said went completely over my head."


translate english day3_amulet_after_76ef7855:


    "But I couldn’t stop looking at her smile, light like a breeze in May, and her eyes, deep and blue."


translate english day3_amulet_after_96bf6be1:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/11 Ch.ogg"
    Pol "One needs to have experience and taste to recognize the music in you."


translate english day3_amulet_after_475e8d65:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/12 E.ogg"
    Pol "You’re not some pop music."


translate english day3_amulet_after_a925e992:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/058.Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I don’t think I even know what blues is."


translate english day3_amulet_after_e6f39c01:


    "Polina gasped and frowned, which made her look even more beautiful."


translate english day3_amulet_after_a28184b0:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/13 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "Don’t say something like that to my face! I’ll make sure to give you a cassette."


translate english day3_amulet_after_e1e5cab9:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/14 R.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa used to bring me so much music from the city! Jazz, swing, and classical too."


translate english day3_amulet_after_ccdfffad:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/15 E.ogg"
    Pol "He was the one to notice my musical mindset."


translate english day3_amulet_after_9365a293:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/16 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "When I was still very little, I tried recording the sounds of nature on paper. The songs of the rain, and the forest…"


translate english day3_amulet_after_159cff4d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/059 Eh.ogg"
    Ant "I wish I had ears like yours."


translate english day3_amulet_after_43952e6c:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/17 A.ogg"
    Pol "And I’d love to have your eyes!"


translate english day3_amulet_after_a3cc9515:


    "I tensed up, worried that she was making fun of me, but Polina shook her head."


translate english day3_amulet_after_6d46ca07:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/18 Da.ogg"
    Pol "No, no, I’m serious. You have the eyes of an artist."


translate english day3_amulet_after_dbad2c12:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/19 S.ogg"
    Pol "You’re so good at picturing things. I can’t do that."


translate english day3_amulet_after_66aba2f9:


    "Katya walked past us with her trademark frosty glare."


translate english day3_amulet_after_bdf2a25b:


    "We dove into the shadows, trying to escape it."


translate english day3_amulet_after_1c29ff9e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/21 t.ogg"
    Pol "You understand why we’re hiding here, right? Because of people like her."


translate english day3_amulet_after_73b76bb2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/060 AKat.ogg"
    Ant "And what kind of melody is Katya?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_7800b077:


    "Polina flashed me a sly smile."


translate english day3_amulet_after_2c3f4132:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/22 Sk.ogg"
    Pol "The squeaking sound of unoiled door hinges."


translate english day3_amulet_after_ed6e52d7:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/23 Z.ogg"
    Pol "You know, this nasty descant."


translate english day3_amulet_after_94f70379:


    "I giggled, covering my mouth."


translate english day3_amulet_after_0a1190a5:


    "Katya didn’t hear our whispers, but she suddenly glanced over her shoulder, clearly annoyed. A moment later, she sighed and went her way."


translate english day3_amulet_after_defff995:


    "I remembered about the notebook I was still clutching in my hand. I turned it in my hands."


translate english day3_amulet_after_afcdc29e:


    "Instead of a subject name, the front side had the name of the owner and two words: \"Friends Only\"."


translate english day3_amulet_after_7cf6454c:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/24 L.ogg"
    Pol "Curiosity killed the cat, you know."


translate english day3_amulet_after_a83f534c:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/062 Pr.ogg"
    Ant "I'm sorry. Is this a questionnaire?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_6b02000a:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/25 Za.ogg"
    Pol "Have you ever filled one?"


translate english day3_amulet_after_c2d19ea7:


    "I lied that I had."


translate english day3_amulet_after_e5412364:


    "In reality, girl classmates from my previous school had never asked me to fill their questionnaires. It was quite upsetting."


translate english day3_amulet_after_37651e1b:


    "I mean, it was a girl hobby; you just answer a set of standard questions about your favorite actors and colors, but entrusting someone with such a notebook was the sign of friendship."


translate english day3_amulet_after_61b9ea7f:


    "And maybe of something even more, something I only had a vague idea about."


translate english day3_amulet_after_b000dcee:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/26 Ho.ogg"
    Pol "You can fill in mine if you want."


translate english day3_amulet_after_d65237c1:


    "My heartbeat quickened."


translate english day3_amulet_after_d33d60bd:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/064 Ho.ogg"
    Ant "I do, thank you."


translate english day3_amulet_after_2baf87f3:


    "Polina giggled."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_f2d44a56:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/27 A.ogg"
    Pol "Actually... there are so many secrets there!"


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_2587a07d:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/28 Na.ogg"
    Pol "You’d be better off not knowing what we, girls, think."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_dc447d71:


    "She reached for the notebook, playing with me. I tossed my finding into my free hand. Polina tried to intercept my move."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_2249b1f4:


    "Her hair briefly touched my face, tickling my nose with its silky locks."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_9d1a7e00:


    "I sensed an aroma that immediately filled the whole world: fragrant, alluring, lively..."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_fc9f8f32:


    "If only I could picture it, steal it for myself!"


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_80109d1f:


    "I felt dizzy, but I gathered myself and spoke in a voice reminiscent of lieutenant Tikhonov:"


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_b5c36104:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/065 Va.ogg"
    Ant "Your questionnaire is an important piece of evidence so I’m afraid I have to confiscate it for further examination."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_a924f44a:


    "Polina covered her mouth that rounded in fake horror."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_ff0b887a:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/29 E.ogg"
    Pol "And what are the implications of concealing evidence?"


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_61544d90:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/066.S.ogg"
    Ant "We’ll decide that in the course of our investigation."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_7844f50b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/30 S.ogg"
    Pol "I surrender, Mr. Policeman."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_2993f416:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/31 T.ogg"
    Pol "Just promise you won't read anything."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_33c34c35:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/32 Z.ogg"
    Pol "It’s full of sensitive information."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_1828e250:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/067 B.ogg"
    Ant "I’m afraid I’ll have to investigate whether someone is in love with Mr. Petrov."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_e07636fd:


    "Polina burst out laughing and pressed herself against my chest, showering me with the aroma of her hair and her milky skin that looked almost transparent, with tiny threads of veins running under it."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_6bbaec61:


    "Her whisper was hot, like a piece of butter sizzling on a pan."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_05c5aa79:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/33 T.ogg"
    Pol "Then swear that you will keep this information private."


translate english day3_polinahall_amuletfox_05915cdf:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/068 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "I swear on my police badge!"


translate english day3_polinahall_ring_1a839ed7:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/34 At.ogg"
    Pol "And now we need to hurry, Antosha."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_7f92231e:


    "I took out the notebook during class."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e45e7040:


    "With utmost care, as if it was some sort of fragile treasure."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_ea6a5bb6:


    "Skimmed through it, reading into other people’s preferences."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_f11a34da:


    "I was quite surprised to discover Romka’s jerky handwriting inside."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_2bec8d72:


    "His letters bulged out of the cells, as if embarrassed by their shapelessness."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_35eb0279:


    "Fearsome Romka found time for something so silly?"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_48fc44ef:


    "I chuckled into my fist after I found out that Romka’s favorite cartoon is not even \"Darkwing Duck\", but \"Duck Tales\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_cca373f4:


    "Somewhere in the distance, a teacher was reciting pieces of Andreev’s “Snapper”. I paid them no mind."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e1d22ccc:


    "Polina’s page was decorated with flower drawings and clippings from the \"Cool girl\" magazine."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_2e90cde8:


    "Her favorite musician is Schubert."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_c808c3d6:


    "Her best friend is her grandpa."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_0101639e:


    "Her hobby is not violin, like I expected, but a much more mysterious \"listening\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_2b7e3e69:


    "Can such a mundane process really be someone’s hobby?"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_f369ca00:


    "I looked at Polina over the heads of other students. She was focused on taking notes."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e71e71c0:


    "I flipped the pages until I found a blank one and armed myself with a pen."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_f5d8ef70:


    "Anton Petrov. Class 6 \"B\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_c45980e9:


    "Favorite holiday… This one’s easy. New Year’s."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_519220e0:


    "My hobby is drawing."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_955764f1:


    "My dream… Going to Disneyland, I guess."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_8eadd7a5:


    "My hero."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_d903b6c7:


    "My hand moved on its own, writing \"Da...\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_1f21c3d9:


    "I stopped on those two letters. What if those who read this after me will find my answer laughable and stupid?"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_1e9b9018:


    "After thinking for a bit, I decided that not everything should be disclosed on paper."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e7258088:


    "That’s how \"Da\" turned into \"SpiDar Man\". The spelling was wrong, but who cares?"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_8531b6b0:


    "Your biggest fear, huh?"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_a0dd1eb4:


    "I immediately wrote: losing a person who’s dear to me."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_1f023c1e:


    "Your phone number."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_20732a48:


    "No secret here: 3-03-95"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_1b843023:


    "Your favorite cartoon."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_ae39e5ff:


    "Transformers."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_f67c6a11:


    "Your best friend..."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e20ebf1a:


    "I hesitated, gnawing on the pen’s cap."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_3f58d5b0:


    "I remembered Alisa, gliding behind the trees, laughing enthusiastically from the shadows."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_5215dbd2:


    "I hadn’t seen her in a week and it even made me worried."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_7ad99175:


    "After all, she was the one who stopped the colossus of a monster that wanders the forest in the night from tearing me to bits."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_8f045cae:


    "I mentioned a \"masked girl\" to Romka and Byasha before, but they just gave me weird looks."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_c7ef351e:


    "I wonder what she’s up to right now… "


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_2e530719:


    "\"Your best friend,\" I read the question out loud. It was easy, but at the same time very important."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_b466ada4:


    "My answer consisted of three letters and I filled them in the cells with care:"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_30bf1b93:


    "\"You\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_5ff4fe07:


    "\"You,\" I repeated when running out of the school."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_d7598c5b:


    "Refreshing frosty air made my cheeks turn beet red."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_5e46e232:


    "It was bright outside, and the sun looked like a whole egg yolk."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_44791357:


    "The road looked as if it was silvered: the snow sparkled under the sunlight. I smiled, squinting from the blinding whiteness."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_075fd31f:


    "There was also something magical in my chest that beckoned me."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_d23f8072:


    "Because friendship can grow into something bigger."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_c939b9f2:


    "The answer to that was my sister’s name, so I carefully wrote it into the squares:"


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_c3ff8367:


    "\"Olya\"."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_7f5c998e:


    "\"Olya,\" I repeated my sister's name while sneaking out of the school."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_55fdf8f0:


    "There was a cute freshly drawn dragon in my notebook that I made to please my beloved sister."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_4937b9c6:


    "In this land of darkness and deceit, her support was the only thing that inspired me to keep drawing and stopped me from losing hope in humanity."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_d7598c5b_1:


    "Refreshing frosty air made my cheeks turn beet red."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_5e46e232_1:


    "It was bright outside, and the sun looked like a whole egg yolk."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_44791357_1:


    "The road looked as if it was silvered, the snow sparkled under the sunlight. I smiled, squinting from the blinding whiteness."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_8ca52407:


    "Who cares if I don’t have any true friends anymore."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_aff56b60:


    "I have something more important. Someone who needs my help, who will never betray or hurt me."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_884228e6:


    "Family is the most important thing ever. That’s what dad always told me."


translate english day3_corner_fox_92851a1b:



    voice "voice/byasha/125 Tosh.ogg"
    Bya "What’s with the happy face, Tosha?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_4ef8917f:


    "I swallowed my smile and turned red."


translate english day3_corner_fox_9b4fea9d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/070 Aneg.ogg"
    Ant "I just remembered a joke."


translate english day3_corner_fox_9d3571b2:


    "Byasha was shuffling his feet in the middle of the yard, his boots restless on the ice."


translate english day3_corner_fox_4ce0fb50:



    voice "voice/byasha/126 Nu.ogg"
    Bya "Share it with me, eh."


translate english day3_corner_fox_fe04b8aa:


    "I rummaged through my memory and blurted out a random joke I’d heard today in the cafeteria."


translate english day3_corner_fox_f0ec7842:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/069 Ko.ogg"
    Ant "Why did the chewing gum cross the road? It was stuck to the chicken's foot."


translate english day3_corner_fox_c6a30e12:



    voice "voice/byasha/127 Yasno.ogg"
    Bya "I see, {u}Petrosyan{/u}."


translate english day3_corner_fox_70213e20:



    voice "voice/byasha/128 NuIdem.ogg"
    Bya "Let’s go, eh."


translate english day3_corner_fox_17f1ef2b:


    "He walked toward the school’s corner without waiting for me. I hesitantly tagged along."


translate english day3_corner_fox_bca22474:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/071 A.ogg"
    Ant "Where are we going?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_a711250f:



    voice "voice/byasha/129 Idem А.ogg"
    Bya "You’ll see, eh."


translate english day3_corner_fox_bbbc0907:



    voice "voice/byasha/130 mi.ogg"
    Bya "We’re now in one pack, so we move together."


translate english day3_corner_fox_d15ca125:



    voice "voice/byasha/131 Po.ogg"
    Bya "You’ll need to help us with some small business."


translate english day3_corner_fox_867c30bb:


    "I felt chills run all over my body. I didn’t like the sound of that \"small business\"."


translate english day3_corner_fox_ceec2a79:


    "Those words, accompanied by spitting, normally hid very dark deeds underneath them."


translate english day3_corner_fox_fc4bf575:


    "Strangers that used to call our old apartment used to say: “Get your old man, we have a small business to discuss”."


translate english day3_corner_fox_2ed09bd9:


    "Byasha turned around. He looked like an astronaut in this tight hood."


translate english day3_corner_fox_8784baf2:


    "If I were to imagine him as a sound, he’d be a deafening whistle, a signal given by someone, who stands watch."


translate english day3_corner_fox_0d73765d:


    "My knees started shaking as soon as I thought that I was about to be dragged into something shady."


translate english day3_corner_fox_2a9ce2a6:


    "Images flashed before my eyes: Tikhonov’s strict gaze as he shuts the prison cell door on me, my father hitting the bars in anger, mom and Olya crying nearby… "


translate english day3_corner_fox_b88cb265:


    "To my demise, there was nobody at the back yard. "


translate english day3_corner_fox_c0858647:


    "Apart from the grim-faced Romka."


translate english day3_corner_fox_a781b17d:


    "He stood there, his feet wide apart, with his right hand hidden behind his back."


translate english day3_corner_fox_35ef256d:


    "He must be holding a knife. The steel butterfly of death that flies toward a person’s heartbeat."


translate english day3_corner_fox_232991b5:


    "Romka’s dry lips were tightly pursed, he kept shooting glances at me as he looked around."


translate english day3_corner_fox_083c67cf:


    "What’s going on?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_69df07b3:


    "It was as if Romka read and announced my thoughts."


translate english day3_corner_fox_4b894ea1:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/01 Ct.ogg"
    Rom "What’s going on?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_abf41794:



    voice "voice/byasha/132 Niche.ogg"
    Bya "Nothing much. We're out for a walk, eh."


translate english day3_corner_fox_aa90ad60:


    "Byasha’s voice sounded nasty, snarky."


translate english day3_corner_fox_45dee8b5:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/02 Pr.ogg"
    Rom "Walk some other way."


translate english day3_corner_fox_52b909ad:



    voice "voice/byasha/134 A mne.ogg"
    Bya "We like it here. Right, baby?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_02ee3918:


    "Baby? Is he talking to me?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_b607d0be:


    "I was so bewildered I wasn’t able to squeeze out a single sound in reply."


translate english day3_corner_fox_be4f1a0c:


    "I just watched the bizarre scene, played out in front of me by my new problematic friends."


translate english day3_corner_fox_6d19609d:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/03 Vi.ogg"
    Rom "Look, you scared her."


translate english day3_corner_fox_a94fd886:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/136 Atebe.ogg"
    Bya "What do you care, shithead? Fuck off while you still can, eh."


translate english day3_corner_fox_f36f79ad:


    "I was trying to digest what I just heard. Did Byasha really call Romka a shithead? Is he out of his mind?"


translate english day3_corner_fox_dc1e2187:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/072 Pa.ogg"
    Ant "Guys..."


translate english day3_corner_fox_6019df39:


    "Byasha ignored my weak protests and stepped toward Roma, swung at him in a weird, comical manner."


translate english day3_corner_fox_286f27a3:


    "Romka blocked the punch with his free hand, keeping his right hand behind his back."


translate english day3_corner_fox_8c7f0c7e:


    "Even actors in Indian films that my mom loves fight more convincingly."


translate english day3_corner_fox_0e9e3249:


    "Byasha started weeping even though I hadn’t seen Romka hitting him."


translate english day3_corner_fox_026c06af:



    voice "voice/byasha/138 Ai.ogg"
    Bya "Ow, ow, ow, it hurts, I have a concussion now!"


translate english day3_corner_fox_d01bb4fd:


    "Roma kicked him in the knee, and Byasha fell to the ground, sighing and moaning."


translate english day3_corner_fox_0e42e060:


    "And I stared at the approaching Romka without blinking."


translate english day3_corner_fox_28c50920:


    "His elbow was twitching and his hand crawled from behind his back. I grew roots into the asphalt."


translate english day3_corner_fox_8cee35ae:


    "A blade will shine in front of me."


translate english day3_corner_fox_68d03680:


    "Here it comes!"


translate english day3_corner_fox_58ed6067:


    "Romka yanked his hand from behind his back. My teeth chattered from fear."


translate english day3_corner_fox_775583cc:


    "A bouquet of snowdrops, that appeared out of nowhere in this freezing weather, swayed in front of my face."


translate english day3_corner_fox_920a806c:


    "What’s this? Flowers?!"


translate english day3_corner_fox_fcffa732:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/05 Poz.ogg"
    Rom "Let me escort you."


translate english day3_corner_fox_d2867a7f:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/06 Ato.ogg"
    Rom "You know, there are all sorts of… creeps snooping around here."


translate english day3_corner_fox_e7b2cd18:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/141 N.ogg"
    Bya "What’s wrong with innocent creeps doing a bit of snooping about, eh?"


