    "I didn’t like the sounds of that \"small business\"."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_ceec2a79:


    "Those words, accompanied by spitting, normally hid very dark deeds underneath them."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_fc4bf575:


    "Strangers that used to call our old apartment used to say: \"Get your old man, we have a small business to discuss.\""


translate english day3_corner_notfox_2ed09bd9:


    "Byasha turned around. He looked like an astronaut in this tight hood."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_63d6cecd:


    "If I were to imagine him as a sound, he’d be a deafening whistle, a signal given by someone who stands watch."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_b88cb265:


    "To my demise, there was nobody at the back yard. "


translate english day3_corner_notfox_c0858647:


    "Apart from the grim-faced Romka."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_02bbfa4d:


    "He stood there, his feet wide apart, with his right hand hidden behind his back."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_9fa11c47:


    "Romka’s dry lips were tightly pursed, he kept shooting glances at me as he looked around. "


translate english day3_corner_notfox_bbb85dc9:


