translate english day3_corner_notfox_7e9921e7:


    "The blade slid across my sleeve with its dull side and reached my collar."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_c59eb11f:


    "The wind made my face cold, but a bead of sweat still trickled from my temple."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_65c1c71b:


    "A switch flipped in my head. It all made sense now."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_8d89cc2c:


    "I remembered Romka constantly sneaking glances at Polina."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_c28b16cc:


    "I remembered his scrawly handwriting in the questionnaire. Why didn’t I study it more in-depth?"


translate english day3_corner_notfox_e4be2bd4:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/60 Ese.ogg"
