    voice "voice/romka/3day/62 Von.ogg"
    Rom "Scram!"


translate english day3_corner_notfox_f3fe10a1:


    "I thought about the cold sharp blade when retreating from the yard."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_63d8c126:


    "I was asking myself whether I had enough courage to break the promise I made to these bastards."


