    "The split-up handle and the blade spun in a dangerous dance, just like helicopter blades that sweep away everything in their way."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_1e7aae31:


    "I tried to dodge, but the sharp edge of the blade grazed my shoulder."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_7f511f95:


    "I watched in shock as the blade sunk into my skin, tearing it filling the gash with blood."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_643a22f4:


    "The rush brought by adrenaline faded away and the piercing pain escaped my mouth in the form of a pitiful scream."


