    voice "voice/anton/3day/088 AAAAAA.ogg"
    Ant "Аaаh!"


translate english day3_corner_notfox_4a9f0bea:


    "Romka pulled the knife out with a rough motion and I ran away without looking back, trying to cover the bleeding wound."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_91ef1037:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/65 Po.ogg"
    Rom "Don’t you dare forget again!"


translate english day3_corner_notfox_ace03eb1:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/66 Ant.ogg"
    Rom "Antosha!"


translate english day3_corner_notfox_bf9a99af_1:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/63Na.ogg"
    Rom "I guess I need to explain it in a way you’ll understand..."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_b7c0da96_1:


    "The split-up handle and the blade spun in a dangerous dance, just like helicopter blades that sweep away everything in their way."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_a84d6691:


    "I tried to dodge, but after taking a step backward, I slipped and fell on my butt."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_f76df969:


    "If waiting for this opportunity, Polina’s amulet lunged from under the collar toward the blade. "


translate english day3_corner_notfox_82efa145:


    "The leather cord prevented the claw from piercing the assailants neck, and the charm fell to my chest with a thud."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_df2e0296:


    "I expected to be cut so badly that I’d end up choking on my own blood."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_fa7f31cc:


    "But for some reason, Romka just stood there, staring at me."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_2e5516ff:


    "He had his knife ready to cut, but his eyes were fixated on the bauble hanging from my neck. He growled something evil under his breath."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_7160c981:


    "Polina’s gift was driving Romka crazy, but it tied his hands at the same time."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_e8346b0d:


    "The pause lasted so unnaturally long that it made Byasha frown in confusion."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_922a4b86:


