translate english day3_corner_notfox_2a0ea734:


    "I felt the rush of adrenaline and sprinted away, almost taking off into the air."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_1957bf2b:


    "Romka came to his senses when I was already far away so he shouted his dreadful warning at my back."


translate english day3_corner_notfox_91ef1037_1:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/65 Po.ogg"
