translate english day3_corner_notfox_ace03eb1_1:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/66 Ant.ogg"
    Rom "Antosha!"


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_ac64a469:


    "The aftertaste of horrible water I drank down my meds with lingered in my mouth."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_94278a10:


    "A cut that was covered with iodine nagged under the wraps with fluffy ends."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_3e3ff7d5:


    "I didn’t tell my parents the truth about how I got it, saying that I just stumbled upon a sharp branch in the forest."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_9dbb44d3:


    "I waited for a chance to get attention from my parents who were always so busy."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_1b82c94b:


    "My thoughts were focused on Polina."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_8b6d1cd1:


    "But Romka’s threat was also on my mind."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_6ab6e41b:


    "But the play where I was assigned the role of a villain was also on my mind."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_6659d757:


    "I wandered around the house, feeling intoxicated, and nodded to everything my sister said without trying to discern her words."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_e59e8152:


    "Olya was talking non-stop, at times lifting up her arms and laughing, only to then suddenly go quiet and give me mom’s signature gnarly look."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_d1d96c97:


    "I was yanked out of the prison of my own mind, where seething thoughts pecked at my brain like harpies, stopping me from coming back to reality."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_e9cd8dcd:


    "I stared back. Olya looked like a mini version of our mom right now. "


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_795cd405:


    "Well, to be precise, she looked like the person mom turned into when we moved here: with her intimidating posture and her eyebrows directed toward the ceiling."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_8ef16303:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/02 Ti.ogg"
    Oly "You weren’t listening to me, were you?!"


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_d6707c40:


    "She tried spitting out those words at me, copying facial expressions of the person she spent almost all of her free time with."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_9468b3fd:


    "For a moment I felt like the light Olya exuded all these years waned and wavered in the wind of prolonged changes. "


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_544d919d:


    "Very soon, my beautiful princess will turn into the dragon that was once guarding her prison tower. That thought was much scarier to me than any other horror sneaking up to me from the future."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_e6f43059:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/04 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, Olya..."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_b2cfae7b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/05T.ogg"
    Ant "I didn’t want to make you mad. I just got lost in thought."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_7ac2570b:


    "I looked around the room, my gaze jumping from one object to another like a hungry beast, trying to find anything that could disctract Olya."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_ae2de6bd:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/06 A.ogg"
    Ant "Let’s play the console!"


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_4a13ca17:


    "Olya pouted, but there was a spark of interest in her small emerald eyes. "


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_ca63da58:


    "The Snow Queen's ice shard inside them started thawing."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_3b7bf4e4:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/04 A.ogg"
    Oly "And what about the second controller? It’s not working."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_a66f4d92:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/05 A.ogg"
    Oly "And dad has no time to fix it..."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_7f361827:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/07 M.ogg"
    Ant "Hm... We can play with the light gun."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_4ced8023:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/08 V.ogg"
    Ant "What do you want to play? Cowboys, ducks?"


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_33067940:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/06 Т.ogg"
    Oly "You’re better than me at both."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_ccb42ec2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/09 Da.ogg"
    Ant "Oh, come on."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_7643f2b1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/10 P.ogg"
    Ant "You must’ve been practicing the whole time I was away from home."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_4571a709:


    "Olya burst out laughing. Her heart was warm once again."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_7b7ebfc8:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/08 A.ogg"
    Oly "How did you know?"


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_e178081f:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/09 Ya.ogg"
    Oly "But I’m a good shooter now! You’ve already lost."


translate english dev_d3_olyatalk_end_18196794:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/11 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "You’ve picked the wrong fight here! Come on, turn it on!"


translate english open_box_table_db7c425d:


    "I hid Semyon’s signet ring in my desk’s drawer. "


translate english open_box_table_b4f40b9d:


    "Then I relocated to my sister's room."


translate english open_box_table_ba415a04:


    "Little Olya jumped toward the TV set and, after flicking the power switch, started blindly feeling around the back side of the “Photon”, trying to plug the console’s cable into the antenna input."


translate english open_box_table_41a61dd1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/12 Ch.ogg"
    Ant "Did anything interesting happen at home?"


translate english open_box_table_438eae8b:


    "It was a mundane question for me, I didn’t put any actual meaning behind it. "


translate english open_box_table_f04a93c5:


    "But Olya’s expression suddenly changed, she lost all of the childish nonchalantness she worked so hard to acquire before."


translate english open_box_table_0c4847c0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/13 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "What happened, Olya?"


translate english open_box_table_3a3f10ce:


    "My sister managed to put the cable in its place and started brushing off her dust-covered hand. "


translate english open_box_table_ef08b76f:


    "She was clearly looking for the courage to continue the conversation."


translate english open_box_table_708c5be5:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/13 Ma.ogg"
    Oly "Mom, she..."


translate english open_box_table_ba5417a1:


    "Olya went silent, and for a moment I thought I saw tears welling up in her eyes."


translate english open_box_table_36025220:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/16 U.ogg"
    Oly "She had this scary thing happen to her… again…"


translate english open_box_table_efd839e2:


    "My sister looked at me with wet eyes."


translate english open_box_table_a88ec01c:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/14 P.ogg"
    Ant "...she had a fit, huh."


translate english open_box_table_f665fe9b:


    "This had happened before, but it was a rare occasion. Now that we’d moved to this godforsaken place, mom’s fits rose in frequency."


translate english open_box_table_3fb4082a:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/17 Pa.ogg"
    Oly "Dad brought home a big fish... "


translate english open_box_table_217421b7:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/18 Ona.ogg"
    Oly "It was wrapped in a newspaper and had a foul smell..."


translate english open_box_table_fcd84c3e:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/19 A.ogg"
    Oly "Mom got angry again and then she took a knife."


translate english open_box_table_6a0bcdc6:


    "Olya squirmed, looking fearfully out of the window."


translate english open_box_table_ad18198c:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/20 O.ogg"
    Oly "They started screaming at each other..."


translate english open_box_table_0e746259:


    "I froze, imagining my little sister so small and unnoticeable, standing in the kitchen doorway. "


translate english open_box_table_a6301fd9:


    "She wasn’t even trying to hide, our parents just paid her no mind at all."


translate english open_box_table_56ba1e73:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/21E.ogg"
    Oly "And then mom struck it."


translate english open_box_table_d998d42b:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/22 V.ogg"
    Oly "Like this."


translate english open_box_table_ad8af6b4:


    "Olya slightly moved her fist downward, imitating a strike."


translate english open_box_table_a7298dfd:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/23 R.ogg"
    Oly "She hit the fish."


translate english open_box_table_a749a852:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/24 O.ogg"
    Oly "It was still alive, Tosha. It must’ve been in pain, and mom… mom… "


translate english open_box_table_56dacb65:


    "It was easy to imagine what happened next: the writhing fish with a blade between its fins squirted some foul-smelling musk into mom’s face."


translate english open_box_table_1bf45c52:


    "Whenever death got this close to my mom, be it when a person was hit by a bus in front of us and their blood was smeared all over the windshield..."


translate english open_box_table_42940ea4:


    "...or when grandma chopped off a chicken’s head, mom would always get into a weird, dreadful fit."


translate english open_box_table_333cf89c:


    "Her eyes would roll over, she would fall on her face like a freshly cut tree, and started writhing just like that agonizing fish, turning over chairs and blurting out bits of scary sentences."


translate english open_box_table_3d3d9d70:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/15 A.ogg"
    Ant "And what about dad? Did he help her?"


translate english open_box_table_5bdbe820:


    "Olya shuddered, as if just remembering it pained her."


translate english open_box_table_2e3f5781:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/26 Da.ogg"
    Oly "Yes. But at first... "


translate english open_box_table_90bc00f8:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/27 On.ogg"
    Oly "He started laughing, Tosha!"


translate english open_box_table_22f9618c:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/28 T.ogg"
    Oly "He let out an evil laugh when he saw that mom was in trouble..."


translate english open_box_table_7572e0d3:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/29 A.ogg"
    Oly "...but then he cried."


translate english open_box_table_affd2b7d:


    "Olya's story made me raise an eyebrow."


translate english open_box_table_724545cf:


    "It seemed like the forest's oozing madness had not only completely consumed our mom, but also infected our strong and courageous dad."


translate english open_box_table_14d17451:


    "I quickly stepped toward Olya and locked her in a tight embrace."


translate english open_box_table_7a7740dd:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/30 Z.ogg"
    Oly "Why are they bullying each other, Tosha?"


translate english open_box_table_e8740cc5:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/31 Oni.ogg"
    Oly "Are they crazy?"


translate english open_box_table_dad6c61e:


    "I stuttered, unable to justify the actions of our parents."


translate english open_box_table_dc9ad77d:


    "I had ran out of words, and all I could do was hug Olya even tighter."


translate english open_box_table_5471976a:


    "Olya screamed and hid behind me."


translate english open_box_table_944a1b17:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/33 Per .ogg"
    Oly "Turn it off, quick!"


translate english open_box_table_5aa9ec71:


    "No matter how many times she saw this intro, she would always react the same… just like when she saw that owl."


translate english open_box_table_7c282941:


    "I mean, I also got goosebumps every time this {u}ghastly face{/u} appeared on the screen so I immediately complied with my sister’s request."


translate english day3_goosehunt_e32f059f:


    "Finally, the game selection screen showed up for the cartridge that was bundled with the console. "


translate english day3_goosehunt_d4658a9f:


    "Too bad most of the names here were just different levels of the same game."


translate english day3_goosehunt_b4269dfb:


    "I picked up the gray rectangular controller and started looking around the pixel letters to find the familiar English word for \"duck\"."


translate english day3_goosehunt_0511ee60:


    "Background music from the menu soothed Olya's mind and she asked in a calm voice:"


translate english day3_goosehunt_2f558bbf:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/34 Aka.ogg"
    Oly "How are things at school?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_af1465c4:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/34 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I became friends with a girl."


translate english day3_goosehunt_20581887:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/54 A.ogg"
    Oly "Is she pretty?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_7f15ab29:


    "I got embarrassed."


translate english day3_goosehunt_f42917b3:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/35 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Well... I don’t know."


translate english day3_goosehunt_95990784:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/55 Xa.ogg"
    Oly "Ha, you're red. She must be very pretty!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_3f520a9f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/36 Pe.ogg"
    Ant "Stop it, Olya."


translate english day3_goosehunt_ffc67c76:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/56 Vl.ogg"
    Oly "You got a crush on her!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_9fbc738b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/37 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, keep acting like this and I won’t play with you."


translate english day3_goosehunt_20c05d35:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/57 D.ogg"
    Oly "Hahaha, I was joking!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_eee9f35a:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/58 A.ogg"
    Oly "Will you introduce us?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_0544d9f7:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/38 Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Uh… maybe."


translate english day3_goosehunt_1433960d:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/59 Ak.ogg"
    Oly "And what’s her name?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_c59a979b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/39 P.ogg"
    Ant "P-Polina..."


translate english day3_goosehunt_b68c1a49:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/60 Pok.ogg"
    Oly "You turned red again!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_5137f46a:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/61 A.ogg"
    Oly "Where will you live when you get married?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_980a9436:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/40 M.ogg"
    Ant "Are we playing or not?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_a1f273f4:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/41 Da.ogg"
    Ant "I made a couple of friends... I guess."


translate english day3_goosehunt_a2a46b98:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/63 Og.ogg"
    Oly "Wow! A whole two of them! Lucky."


translate english day3_goosehunt_0f654aa0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/42 A.ogg"
    Ant "Right, didn't you say you saw a fox?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_9d3052c9:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/64 Aga.ogg"
    Oly "Yeah. Her name is Alisa."


translate english day3_goosehunt_9dfbdcf0:


    "I immediately felt uneasy when my new acquaintance was mentioned."


translate english day3_goosehunt_98967370:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/43 Ot.ogg"
    Ant "How did you know? Did she tell you?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_b234b2b1:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/64 da.ogg"
    Oly "Yes, when mom and I were throwing out garbage. She also said that she saved you."


translate english day3_goosehunt_00ae6be4:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/44 S.ogg"
    Ant "Saved me...?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_41334921:


    "I remembered my fight with the delinquents in the forest, and that mysterious whisper from the thicket."


translate english day3_goosehunt_df532002:


    "I remembered the fleeing Semyon, and the horned giant towering above me, with its outstretched hand."


translate english day3_goosehunt_6af72e3e:


    "All that time I could feel Alisa's unseen presence, as if she was watching me from behind the crooked trees, a smile stuck to her ginger mask."


translate english day3_goosehunt_834d55eb:


    "I shuddered, chasing away this delusion."


translate english day3_goosehunt_d40a40ba:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/45 A.ogg"
    Ant "Did she say anything else?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_1e3cfcbd:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/65 Nea.ogg"
    Oly "Nuh-uh."


translate english day3_goosehunt_ec84c30f:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/66 Ma.ogg"
    Oly "Mom came back so fast. I wanted to introduce them, but the fox has already ran off."


translate english day3_goosehunt_dd1f9828:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/46 T.ogg"
    Ant "Aren't you afraid of her?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_9bb48ca7:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/67 A.ogg"
    Oly "Why would I? Alisa is kind, she's so fluffy and pretty..."


translate english day3_goosehunt_0722b841:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/68 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "Unlike that owl."


translate english day3_goosehunt_c9f0db26:


    "I plugged the light gun into the second controller port, listening to my sister’s laughs."


translate english day3_goosehunt_e4425e18:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/62 Chu.ogg"
    Oly "I go first!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_7c6321c2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/18 Ni.ogg"
    Ant "Nothing good."


translate english day3_goosehunt_f042bc93:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/19 Sh.ogg"
    Ant "The school is new, but my treatment is the same."


translate english day3_goosehunt_b8d138ad:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/20 S.ogg"
    Ant "As if we never moved... I'm so tired of this."


translate english day3_goosehunt_b3397bdb:


    "Before despair could lead me down its depressing road toward the clutches of oppressive thoughts, something evil writhed deep inside my skull."


translate english day3_goosehunt_a62a59e6:


    "Awakening wild and pleasant memories."


translate english day3_goosehunt_9ef13be8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/21 H.ogg"
    Ant "{i}Actually... Something good did happen.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_2cc154ff:


    "Olya watched with hope-filled eyes as a wicked smile spread on my face, faintly resembling the wound from a box-cutter knife."


translate english day3_goosehunt_1264792f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/22 E.ogg"
    Ant "{i}Another boy went missing.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_f4aff973:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/35 To.ogg"
    Oly "Tosha, do you think that's good? Why do you say that?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_2aa336f4:


    "My sister's voice trembled, when she looked into my eyes through the thick lenses."


translate english day3_goosehunt_d7f45e6e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/23 Z.ogg"
    Ant "{i}You know, that other missing boy, Vova... Maybe what happened to him was all his fault?{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_75db774a:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/24 M.ogg"
    Ant "{i}Maybe he did something so bad... that he no longer deserved to live.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_41b6653c:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/36 Ne.ogg"
    Oly "Don't be so cruel, please!"


translate english day3_goosehunt_6a3205a1:


    "Olya pressed her knees into her chin and hugged them with her hands, trying to take up less space."


translate english day3_goosehunt_8631f769:


    "As if she wanted to shrink or even disappear altogether."


translate english day3_goosehunt_dc656140:


    "It was the only reasonable thing for us to do. Go missing among all the other broken toys."


translate english day3_goosehunt_79c12299:


    "And never encounter evil parents or mad classmates."


translate english day3_goosehunt_f9108c8f:


    "We're the only ones left for each other. The only ones who can protect, listen, and sympathize."


translate english day3_goosehunt_a40b485e:


    "Which means she's bound to listen to what I think about them all: these beasts, pretending to be children, that are so eager to bully the weak."


translate english day3_goosehunt_04ac3e1a:


    "It was my turn to speak."


translate english day3_goosehunt_13ce5b95:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/25 D.ogg"
    Ant "{i}I think they won't be the last.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_7abe357b:


    "My breathing quickens. My fingers start banging on the wooden floor."


translate english day3_goosehunt_5a7dc737:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/27 Ta.ogg"
    Ant "{i}People like them are not worthy of living, going to the same school with us...{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_6fda86c9:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/28 S.ogg"
    Ant "{i}...or looking at your light.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_204eb195:


    "My thoughts got tangled, they slipped away along with my calmness."


translate english day3_goosehunt_1c87c051:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/37 To.ogg"
    Oly "Tosha, stop it! You're scaring me."


translate english day3_goosehunt_29d2d913:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/29 Ne.ogg"
    Ant "{i}Don't be scared, I can protect you.{/i}"


translate english day3_goosehunt_bbe90ca0:


    "Then I finally noticed that Olya was looking at me like I was a stranger."


translate english day3_goosehunt_96f2087d:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/38 Kto.ogg"
    Oly "W-who are you?"


translate english day3_goosehunt_05736369:


    "The rage that welled up inside me subsided. It hid under the guise of my cowardliness, leaving me alone with the growing feeling of guilt for scaring my sister."


translate english day3_goosehunt_8a8384ff:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/30 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, I'm sorry... I ddin't mean to."


translate english day3_goosehunt_2bcb01f4:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/31 Vi.ogg"
    Ant "I guess I'm just going crazy in that school."


translate english day3_goosehunt_70c0e300:


    "She rushed to embrace me, barely holding back her tears."


translate english day3_goosehunt_682c2eaf:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/39 V.ogg"
    Oly "It's okay, Tosha, just please, never say anything like this again."


translate english day3_goosehunt_701d1213:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/32 K.ogg"
    Ant "I swear on mom's heart."


translate english day3_goosehunt_1d4eda92:


    "Olya flashed me a bitter smile."


translate english day3_goosehunt_7dcf1617:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/40 A.ogg"
    Oly "And you told me I should't say that..."


translate english day3_goosehunt_8b431be7:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/33 T.ogg"
    Ant "You're right. Let's start playing already."


translate english day3_goosehunt_b90f0b70:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/41 To.ogg"
    Oly "I go first!"


translate english day3_goose_round_1_79c3a653:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/47 S.ogg"
    Oly "I was going easy on you here!"


translate english day3_goose_round_1_56dd8ef9:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/50 M.ogg"
    Oly "Nice shot."


translate english day3_goose_round_1_85738752:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/44 Nu.ogg"
    Oly "Let's get dangerous!"


translate english day3_goose_round_2_71c23c46:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/48 bu.ogg"
    Oly "Boo! It's your fault I missed."


translate english day3_goose_round_2_c137d747:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/51 Hor.ogg"
    Oly "Nice! Almost as good as me."


translate english day3_goose_round_2_50ca3a26:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/45 Kto.ogg"
    Oly "Ha! Who wants some more?"


translate english day3_goose_round_3_9dec04d2:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/43Ne.ogg"
    Oly "This doesn't count! You were closer to the screen. I'm not playing with you anymore!"


translate english day3_goose_round_3_7f59a4a0:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/52 Au.ogg"
    Oly "This is a draw, Tosha."


translate english day3_goose_round_3_458a6d85:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/42 Pif.ogg"
    Oly "Bang! Bang! And they're dead! You've lost, Tosha."


translate english dendy_jack_turnoff_6c1708d2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/47 Po.ogg"
    Ant "Okay, we're done playing."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_2e72ad77:


    "My mom only managed to get through to me on her third attempt."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_85f4eae0:



    voice "voice/karina/3day/122 Teb.ogg"
    Mam "Anton! There’s a call for you!"


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_e4154753:



    voice "voice/karina/3day/123 Dev.ogg"
    Mam "It’s a girl."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_d22c2df4:


    "I sobered up in an instant and rushed to the hallway."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_8ada454c:



    voice "voice/karina/3day/124 Ne.ogg"
    Mam "Watch your step!"


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_143d1e85:


    "I grabbed the phone, pressed it into my chest, looking at my mom. "


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_e37576b0:


    "She shrugged and went into the room, gathering the toys thrown around by Olya, as she went."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_e41e11c0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/090 A.ogg"
    Ant "Hello!"


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_1178423e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/35 Utv.ogg"
    Pol "Your mom has such a young voice."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_a395eee0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/091 Anu.ogg"
    Ant "Well… yeah. I mean, she is young."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_f37965a8:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/36 Ne.ogg"
    Pol "Are you busy right now?"


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_1fb51028:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/092 Net.ogg"
    Ant "No, of course not."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_5808c1e0:


    "If only she knew how costly this conversation could be for me, what risks I took on just answering this call."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_26721d51:


    "There were a pen and a shabby notepad lying on the nightstand."


translate english dev_d3_polinacall_end_e5ef19e3:


    "I picked them up and started moving the tip of the pen across paper, producing chaotic doodles that always ended up turning into hearts."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_50ceacba:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/90 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I’ve been thinking... I need to tell you something."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_60af9f29:


    "I froze."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_fe7ea42b:


    "It can’t be! Does she like me?"


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_1bd5210a:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/92 V.ogg"
    Pol "You’ve been looking so lost lately."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_cc0d6b21:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/93 A.ogg"
    Pol "And when I saw you at school today, you were pale like a ghost."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_61a8c3cf:


    "I couldn’t find words. My heart was aflutter in anticipation."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_04a18908:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/94 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I wanted to say..."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_1f1650c2:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/95 Y.ogg"
    Pol "That I’m on your side."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_213f397a:


    "A smile was spreading on my face in anticipation for Polina’s next words."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_1b174b6e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/96 E.ogg"
    Pol "And I feel so sorry for you."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_3e4f6371:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/97 Ta.ogg"
    Pol "Good guys like you deserve better."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_ecece9d8:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/98 M.ogg"
    Pol "I want to believe that you’ll find the strength to fight back at some point and the others will stop picking on you."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_1ebe9e51:


    "The pen fell out of my weak fingers."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_94c42218:


    "Is that all she’s going to say?"


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_51f9a8c9:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/99 Mo.ogg"
    Pol "Maybe you’ll even find a girlfriend..."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_038bdee9:


    "She sounded as if she was unsure of her own words."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_96bc9559:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/100 K.ogg"
    Pol "Well, I just wanted to let you know that you’re a nice guy!"


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_624e1679:


    "It was a total failure."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_ecbcbeb9:


    "Compassion instead of an invitation to hang out."


translate english day3_polinacall_solo_5667ebcd:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/101 T.ogg"
    Pol "You there?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_0a04d95d:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/37 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I’ve read your answers."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_55a1f3e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/38 A.ogg"
    Pol "Do you really like \"Car-Man\"?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_810315b8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/051 Mne.ogg"
    Ant "I like Russian rock more, to be honest."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_b996611e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/052 No.ogg"
    Ant "But I was too embarrassed to put it there for some reason."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_593e4e62:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/39 A.ogg"
    Pol "And do you want me to be honest with you, too, Antosha?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_550ebf1d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/094 K.ogg"
    Ant "Of course."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_df06e6bd:


    "My pen drew an outline of a girl’s face, her eyes, her long eyelashes."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_a3ec4b82:


    "Polina spoke in a hushed voice, probably to keep her grandpa from hearing:"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_f42fbbdc:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/40 Mn.ogg"
    Pol "I’m bored to death here."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_d8d75548:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/095 Doma.ogg"
    Ant "At home?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_71a9e6a0:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/41 V.ogg"
    Pol "In the village."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_e8738262:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/42 Z.ogg"
    Pol "There’s nothing going on here, and if there is, it’s always something nasty."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_36455264:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/43 E.ogg"
    Pol "And it’s not even about the missing kids."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_f6b2ec30:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/44 Zd.ogg"
    Pol "There’s almost no music here."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_cce43d8b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/096 No.ogg"
    Ant "Don’t you have your cassettes?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_db06d603:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/45 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I’m not talking about audio records."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_d9627168:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/46 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I mean… this place’s voice."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_2191c862:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/47 On.ogg"
    Pol "It’s not melodic at all. It’s rustling like a record player needle, it just squeaks and moans from time to time."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_7bef130e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/48 T.ogg"
    Pol "It feels uncomfortable, suffocating."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_4d1f3b35:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/49 N.ogg"
    Pol "I don’t know how else to explain this."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_15304bb0:


    "My pen’s tip drafted a house, surrounded by tall trees."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_7921fd7b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/097 Ka.ogg"
    Ant "I think I know what you mean."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_9ec12408:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/097 M.ogg"
    Ant "My little sister says that she feels like a prisoner here."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_27384d9e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/50 V.ogg"
    Pol "Me too... but I love grandpa. I don’t want to abandon him."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_00cac59f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/51 A.ogg"
    Pol "Sometimes I just want to escape so badly. Somewhere very far away."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_114ae476:


    "\"{i}Into the forest,{/i}\" I thought half-heartedly, \"{i}to run under the falling snowflakes that make your fur white and the branches that hide you from prying eyes.{/i}\""


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_ec8b8868:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/098 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "When I draw, I feel like I’m transported to another place."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_3a6fda37:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/52 Um.ogg"
    Pol "It’s the same for me and the violin."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_bd02a280:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/53 U.ogg"
    Pol "I ran up the bow straight to the sky."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_b60929ff:


    "I realized I was drawing a butterfly knife. I crossed it over. "


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_ddaf202c:


    "Thinking of Romka ruined my mood."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_cd703907:


    "Should I tell her? Should I warn her about his plans to seduce her?"


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_8c6ba989:


    "I could throw a wrench into those plans."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_1200929f:


    "But what about our Voltron team? They may not be my best friends, but we’re still buddies."


translate english day3_polinacall_notsolo_30da81ac:


    "Who would I become if I betrayed them?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_2d8d3000:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/102 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Polina?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_3153119f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/54 Da.ogg"
    Pol "Yes?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_b0e98b62:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/103YaHo.ogg"
    Ant "I need to tell you something..."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_276b3bc5:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/103Rom.ogg"
    Ant "Romka... has asked me for a favor."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_5be1f3e7:


    "I couldn’t force out a sound, words slipped and fell down my throat."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_2af57ce3:


    "I started wrapping the telephone wire around my finger from nervousness."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_60802132:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/56 A.ogg"
    Pol "Hello, Anton? I can’t hear you."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d71a65fa:


    "I breathed out loudly."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_906caf06:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/105 Romk.ogg"
    Ant "Romka has made me into a serial killer."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_117da0a2:


    "Ringing silence took over the call."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_788e5b0e:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/57 Ha.ogg"
    Pol "Huh? What?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d713e4e8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/106 On.ogg"
    Ant "He asked me to attack you..."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_61f93e62:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/106 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "Like I’m some monster."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_07e0a39e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/107 Aon.ogg"
    Ant "And he’s supposed to show up and save you like a hero."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_8374fe9f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/107 ALe.ogg"
    Ant "Polina?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_185c8086:


    "She didn't respond so I blew into the handset."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_3ca87104:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/58 E.ogg"
    Pol "And? Did you agree?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_6ddaa20e:


    "The tone of her voice became serious, harsh."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d5fe154d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/109 Net.ogg"
    Ant "No! How could you think that?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_6aeb9c34:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/109 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I told you the truth, remember?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_bbaed327:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/110 AR.ogg"
    Ant "Romka and Byasha... we can’t be friends after something like this!"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d9a9cb3b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/59 Ah.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, Anton! Thank you!"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d2489e57:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/60 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I’m so glad to have you on my side."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_92f488d7:


    "My heartbeat quickened. Anxious thoughts about losing Polina passed an imaginary torch to the thrill of meeting her very soon."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_c9f34a3b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/61 P.ogg"
    Pol "I understand how difficult it was for you to divulge something like this."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_ad45a8d5:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/62 S.ogg"
    Pol "You know, grandpa always says that music can cure your soul."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_b8d41ab8:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/63 H.ogg"
    Pol "Do you want me to play something for you?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_d1a4b623:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/111 Gd.ogg"
    Ant "Where? At school?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_039fc416:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/84 N.ogg"
    Pol "No, silly. After school."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_b75cebf9:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/85 P.ogg"
    Pol "Will you come over to my place?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_b24650a1:


    "I dropped my pen, struggling to believe in what I just heard."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_20462e04:


    "Then I rushed to get it from under the nightstand and rammed my head into it."


translate english bunny3_betray_true_ba00cba8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/113. Ko.ogg"
    Ant "O-of course... W-why not?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_2fcd893d:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/86 T.ogg"
    Pol "Tomorrow after school, then?"


translate english bunny3_betray_true_e9c68c1f:


    "A bump was slowly bubbling up on my forehead, but I almost didn’t feel it."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_d64bd744:


    "Yes, Romka did act horrible from time to time, he was unfair toward others and manipulated the weak."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_19ac9d5b:


    "But something told me that friendship wasn’t just a word to him."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_8208a088:


    "Didn't I wish to make friends in this new place?"


translate english bunny3_betray_false_586ea07a:


    "Even though they were as monstrous as the ancient forest scenery outside my window."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_4db2cfc6:


    "I lifted my glasses, rubbed my eyes."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_ec812359:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/114 p .ogg"
    Ant "I wish I could grow up faster."


translate english bunny3_betray_false_14c72694:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/87 D.ogg"
    Pol "Do you think it’ll make life easier?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_c3bee9e8:


    "The doorbell rang before I could reply."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_a302a7b4:


    "My wandering gaze stumbled upon the door."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_0f648fb4:


    "Romka and Byasha came to pick me up for the rehearsal, and I was supposed to help them lure away the girl I like."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_c51260a3:


    "I’ll have to pretend that I’m on their side. For Polina’s sake."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_7cfc5ed9:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/115 Pol.ogg"
    Ant "Polina, wait a moment."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_a57fbc7a:


    "I made a couple of steps and pressed myself into the door."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_2ed98cb9:


    "The lightbulb hanging on the outside illuminated the porch and I could discern two short silhouettes through the frozen peephole."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_026cc7e4:


    "Look what the cat dragged in."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_c22b159b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/116 Pod.ogg"
    Ant "Please wait, I’ll be out in a moment."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_ab5503ca:


    "I returned to the phone and picked up the handset. "


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_b8f740aa:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/117P.ogg"
    Ant "I need to run."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_286d35d3:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/88 Mn.ogg"
    Pol "Me too."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_77f7fa4f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/89 S.ogg"
    Pol "Thanks for lending an ear."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_ad6ddf8b:


    "My ear vibrated from the buzzing sounds."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_2d818370:


    "I lowered the handset on the phone and snuck a peek at the staircase."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_d615ec8a:


    "My mom, engrossed in her favorite TV show, didn’t hear the ringer."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_3d41d291:


    "I put on my shoes and hat without warning anyone and slipped into the dark winter evening."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_91524716:


    "I blinked, getting used to the twilight. The wind plucked at my cheeks."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_1a968b60:


    "It carried the cold, resinous smell of coniferous trees from the forest. Freezing air crackled somewhere in the field."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_f1a371aa:


    "Two shadows loomed in front of the gate. I could only recognize them as my classmates because of their height."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_7b5691dd:


    "I walked toward the fence, listening to the howling wind and the squeaking snow."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_03230067:


    "One of the figures moved and slowly glided toward the thicket like an ice skater."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_7b413ea3:


    "I slowed down and touched my glasses, trying in vain to adjust my vision to the surrounding darkness."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_9c62f274:


    "Worry landed on my shoulders like a weightless snowflake."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_7ec65e70:


    "A snake woke up in my belly and started writhing. I felt nauseous."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_368f1fb8:


    "I thought about home, the flimsy fortress behind my back."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_a5beff51:


    "Mom and Olya were sitting on the second floor of the warm house in front of the TV, watching the adventures of characters in “Santa Barbara” ."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_cd5e4370:


    "I really didn’t want to be a part of Romka’s plan."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_44fff8e5:


    "And what I wanted even less was going there, to the place where a double shadow was wavering in the wind."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_d4df2403:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/154 nu.ogg"
    Bya "Why so slow, eh?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_4b6b59ba:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/154 M.ogg"
    Bya "We’re freezing here!"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_64578e8d:


    "Byasha’s voice was trembling and the restless Romka was letting out clouds of steam. He looked deep in thought… and in love."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_1331160c:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/155 do.ogg"
    Bya "We’re freezing to the bone, eh."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_446bffc3:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/156 Sh.ogg"
    Bya "Move it..."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_2a333df0:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/118 E.ogg"
    Ant "I’m going, I'm going..."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_c3e5ba36:


    "I heaved a deep sigh and walked forward, kicking snow piles."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_f37ce710:


    "Byasha froze in place, facing the taiga."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_044d105e:


    "He was a hand's reach away, and I put my numb wrist on his shoulder for some reason, probably to make sure it wasn’t a dream."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_de9052ee:


    "A pointy beak was directed at me, strewn with feathers that formed an owl face."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_9622065a:


    "Something wearing a bird mask was staring at me."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_fbf307aa:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/01Do.ogg"
    Owl "Hoot-hoot, to the bone."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_40c878b0:


    "The voice sounded exactly like Byasha’s, but there was somebody else hiding behind the feathers and the cardboard."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_5cbc4a5d:


    "I sprinted away as if somebody whipped me."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_1b6468fc:


    "The masked creature only pretended to be Byasha..."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_fox_ed633275:


    Ant_m "{i}They wanted to lure me out!{/i}"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_d30794d7:


    "Before I could reply, Olya descended the stairs."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_0108f33b:


    "She was holding some book in a pink cover: \"Encyclopedia of a Young Lady\"."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_5d0dcffb:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/01 T.ogg"
    Oly "Will you take long?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_059fe1d8:


    "I covered the handset with my hand."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_faf6c0c1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/120Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I’m in the middle of a conversation."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_de34c3c3:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/121Ch.ogg"
    Ant "What happened?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ff92a77d:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/02 Po.ogg"
    Oly "Read me a bedtime story, please."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_52975dd2:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/03 M.ogg"
    Oly "Mom fell asleep."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_4516d61b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/122 Ed.ogg"
    Ant "Go to your room. I’ll be there in a minute."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_29992867:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/04 To.ogg"
    Oly "Just be quick, okay?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_e2982745:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/123La.ogg"
    Ant "Fine!"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_d075eea4:


    "My last reply sounded excessively annoyed. I sighed, watching my sister running up the stairs."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_2dbe9f9c:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/125Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, I need to run."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_286d35d3:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/88 Mn.ogg"
    Pol "Me too."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_77f7fa4f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/89 S.ogg"
    Pol "Thank you for lending an ear."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_b4ae2974:


    "My ear vibrated from the buzzing sounds."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_8818f57b:


    "I dragged my feet to the second floor, thinking of the girl I shouldn’t talk to if I don’t want to die from a knife wound."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_3d446b73:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/099 AlePo.ogg"
    Ant "Hello, Polina?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_3a045ea8:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/102 Pr.ogg"
    Pol "Sorry, I need to run."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_0b9c88fd:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/103 Pre.ogg"
    Pol "Can you imagine? There's someone in love with me and he snoops about under my windows, demanding to go on a date with him."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_2771a01b:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/104 Po.ogg"
    Pol "I’ll go chase him away, before grandpa wakes up."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_85f0f83f:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/105 H.ogg"
    Pol "Hm, or maybe I should give him a chance?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_dc9bd59c:


    "I bit my lower lip in jealousy."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_5011bdaa:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/106 Es.ogg"
    Pol "I’ll tell you tomorrow, if you want."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_c1ba49d2:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/107 M.ogg"
    Pol "We’re friends, after all."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_b22fd947:


    "Friends. At least she didn’t say we were \"besties\". "


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ddb58cf5:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/100 Da.ogg"
    Ant "Y-yeah, sure."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_8c6a4463:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/101Do.ogg"
    Ant "Good..."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_d793aff4:


    "The buzzer hammered at my brain."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_968c8471:


    "\"{i}Dirty slut,{/i}\" an angry voice spoke through the teeth in my brain."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_0d8913fb:


    "Like a restless zombie devoid of a consciousness, I dragged my feet up the staircase."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_4f542cd1:


    "I wish I could tell dad, ask for his manly advice."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_e7070c72:


    "But he doesn’t show up home until late at night because of his new job."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_c9d2c347:


    "My parents don’t have time for me, to put it lightly."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_7bd02e0d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/126Nu.ogg"
    Ant "Well, where’s your book?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_66496bba:


    "I stuttered. The kids room was empty."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_551cc7e2:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/127Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_0e5edc88:


    "She probably snuck into my room."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_f5b8f405:


    "I started walking down the corridor."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_3755b207:


    "The room was infested with shadows. The blinds were wavering like there was someone hiding behind them."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_fed75dab:


    "I smiled. Sneaked toward the window and threw open the curtain."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_46a27e17:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/128 Po.ogg"
    Ant "Gotcha!"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ecb6e16a:


    "There was nobody behind the cloth."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_cb597246:


    "The window was a TV screen showing winter scenery."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ba03f6dc:


    "The lamp post, the field, and a couple of walking figures in the middle of it."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_4cd14038:


    "Alisa and Olya..."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_dc1cd1df:


    "I gasped and pressed my fist to my mouth, sinking my teeth into it."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_f8c9ed5c:


    "Alisa was leading Olya into the thicket."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_43976a4b:


    "I needed less than a minute to hurriedly dress and rush out of the house."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_3d07f08a:


    "My heart was beating like a firing machine gun."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_1a968b60:


    "The wind carried the cold, resinous smell of coniferous trees from the forest. Freezing air crackled somewhere in the field."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_caf29cb6:


    "Two shadows loomed in front of the gate. I could only recognize them as my sister and the fox girl because of their height."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_81192f58:


    "I ran toward the fence, listening to the howling wind and the squeaking snow."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ab308d0c:


    "One of the figures moved and slowly glided toward the thicket like an ice skater."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_7b413ea3:


    "I slowed down and touched my glasses, trying in vain to adjust my vision to the surrounding darkness."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_9c62f274:


    "Worry landed on my shoulders like a weightless snowflake."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_7ec65e70:


    "A snake woke up in my belly and started writhing. I felt nauseous."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_368f1fb8:


    "I thought about my home, the flimsy fortress I’d left behind."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_8dd4bfed:


    "I finally caught up to my sister, dressed only in a coat."


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_424a142f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/130 Ol.ogg"
    Ant "Olya"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_ce1afac3:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/05 T.ogg"
    Oly "Have you seen the foxy?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_73404473:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/131 Olya.ogg"
    Ant "Olya, why did you go outside?"


translate english day3_polinacall_phase2_notfox_367cdf19:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/131 Es.ogg"
    Ant "If mom finds out..."


translate english mold_test_aeaab666:


    "My sister froze in place, facing the taiga. "


translate english mold_test_d351b67d:


    "She was in a hand's reach, and I put my numb wrist on her shoulder for some reason, probably to make sure it wasn’t a dream."


translate english mold_test_de9052ee:


    "A pointy beak was directed at me, strewn with feathers that formed an owl face."


translate english mold_test_9622065a:


    "Something wearing a bird mask was staring at me."


translate english mold_test_06b1f6ec:



    voice "voice/olya/3day/06 Uxu.ogg"
    Owl "Hoot-hoot, she won’t."


translate english mold_test_6d022fa3:


    "The voice sounded exactly like Olya’s, but there was somebody else hiding behind the feathers and the carton."


translate english mold_test_5cbc4a5d:


    "I sprinted away as if I got whipped."


translate english mold_test_eebc51ce:


    "The masked creature only pretended to be Olya..."


translate english mold_test_965b08a3:


    Ant_m "{i}Just to lure me out!{/i}"


translate english day3_night_1a7e13e9:


    "I was running like crazy, drowning in snow."


translate english day3_night_1adeeaae:


    "The house in front of me was rapidly growing."


translate english day3_night_e80ff95d:


    "The yellow light in its windows granted me hope."


translate english day3_night_6d7883c2:


    "My mom and sister are there! My salvation!"


translate english day3_night_9329db49:


    "I couldn’t hear anything from behind me, as if nobody was chasing me."


translate english day3_night_413e8457:


    "Maybe it’s because the owls can fly?"


translate english day3_night_d3dae374:


    "I was already climbing the porch when I noticed another figure."


translate english day3_night_167d6185:


    "From the soot black shadow of my house, a scruffy wolf cub crawled out and stood in my way."


translate english day3_night_27f4e767:


    "Its movements were jerky, chaotic, as if it was performing some terrifying dance..."


translate english day3_night_26d3a1a3:


    "...or convulsing during a stroke."


translate english day3_night_c11dce73:


    "And even though I could clearly see that the wolf face was a mask, something in this werewolf’s convulsions made me freeze in place."


translate english day3_night_8711b342:


    "The boy in a wolf’s costume rubbed his side against the porch post and fell to his knees."


translate english day3_night_cc7c08fe:


    "He bent his back so hard that I expected his spine to crack."


translate english day3_night_07ddcbab:


    "The beast’s eyes shone."


translate english day3_night_a01638b7:


    "But he didn’t attack."


translate english day3_night_1c3f3bab:


    "He kept crawling around and running on all fours."


translate english day3_night_7992895b:


    "I shifted my feet, my mouth agape, trying to keep him in my line of sight."


translate english day3_night_e1b1c613:


    "Something was trickling from the slit in the mask. Viscous drops fell to the wooden planks."


translate english day3_night_0c9bd856:


    "Saliva."


translate english day3_night_d0a6f63a:


    "Some unknown force pushed me in the back, whispering me to save myself."


translate english day3_night_d5ff446b:


    "The fence was flashing by at the edge of my vision."


translate english day3_night_c22f7918:


    "I was running. In another direction this time, toward the toothy edge of the forest that smelled of pine."


translate english day3_night_1b917811:


    "My heartbeat measured time."


translate english day3_night_5b291001:


    "The wolf boy growled behind my back as if he forgot his human nature: "


translate english day3_night_653ea721:



    voice "voice/Wolf/308 GR.ogg"
    Wolf "Grrr... Grrr..."


translate english day3_night_99d1fcf3:


    "My right leg got stuck in the snow-laden cavity."


translate english day3_night_c3938cc3:


    "I yanked it out, cursing under my breath, and fell to the ground."


translate english day3_night_a6aaa2d8:


    "Plastering snow prevented me from standing up, from propping myself against anything."


translate english day3_night_ee23910d:


    "But my unbound thirst for life helped me get out of that trap."


translate english day3_night_d3b965b1:


    "Darkness was creeping closer, like the toxic fumes of burial pyres. I ran again, gasping for air that stung my throat."


translate english day3_night_14e9ce2e:


    "My hair swayed in the wind."


translate english day3_night_300c8747:


    "I lost my hat when I fell down, and my ears were now hot from the freezing cold while most of my body was still sweaty."


translate english day3_night_07528e7a:


    "The field finally ended."


translate english day3_night_751b4f6d:


    "After realizing that running into the forest wasn’t the smartest decision I could make, I dove into the line of trees."


translate english day3_night_07eefd08:


    "I ran without stopping, my face covered with one of my palms."


translate english day3_night_90b35300:


    "I didn’t want to lose an eye to some random branch."


translate english day3_night_d369cad4:


    "Branches whipped my clothes, pricked my skin like butchers that were herding a pig into the grinder."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_d23787c0:


    "A knot of roots, sprouting from the ground, grabbed at my foot."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a23654dc:


    "I rammed into the scratchy trunk, slid down to its base and looked around in a panic."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_6658ba0c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/01 Uh.ogg"
    Alis "Phew, you’re so fast!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_06a57dbf:


    "My first desire was to dash toward her and hug her."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1d627136:


    "I resisted it and squeezed myself even tighter into the pine."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_5bbcfa1d:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/133.Ti.ogg"
    Ant "You... what are you doing here?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_2ae2c44e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/02 Da.ogg"
    Alis "This and that."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_b20198fb:


    "She was holding the hat I lost."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_afccd4f6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/03 V.ogg"
    Alis "Working part time in lost and found."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_cd96a14c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/04 N.ogg"
    Alis "Put it on, or your ears will freeze and maybe even fall off soon."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_d8e2c47f:


    "She giggled."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_fdaa5e55:


    "I squinted in suspicion and shifted my gaze back and forth between her and the hat, scared that Alisa might be holding a severed head or something even more sinister."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_6084c24e:


    "But in the end, my hat turned out to be just my hat."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_7495fd83:


    "I took it and pulled it over my forehead."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_79588491:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/06 T.ogg"
    Alis "Feeling warmer?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_7fe9a557:


    "I didn’t reply."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_e6b8f262:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/134 Tam.ogg"
    Ant "There were some children in the yard."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_5fac3ab4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/07 E.ogg"
    Alis "And? Did they bite you or something?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_b0899b65:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/135 net.ogg"
    Ant "No..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_64731e00:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/08 A.ogg"
    Alis "Then why did you run away?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_c647e0ba:


    "The answer was obvious, but after rolling the thought on my tongue, I mumbled:"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_821821c7:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/136 Nez.ogg"
    Ant "I don’t know..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1fe4f5de:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/09 E.ogg"
    Alis "Ah, why did I promise to never call you a dunce again?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_c6148e59:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/10 A.ogg"
    Alis "Oh well, I keep my promises."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1d75767b:


    "She walked up to me and grabbed me by the elbow."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_76f91645:


    "I sensed the familiar aroma of mint, oranges and burnt sparklers."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_628b39a0:


    "I wanted to lean in to Alice, to savor the minute details of her smell."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_5703dc0f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/11 S.ogg"
    Alis "How many times do I need to tell you? You’re safe as long as you’re with me."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_64bf6ccf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/12 Ya.ogg"
    Alis "I’m your friend."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_9e7780fd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/13 E.ogg"
    Alis "And they are too."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_5f3fb549:


    "I quickly turned around toward the place the fox girl was pointing to."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_44cabe5d:


    "Kids in masks appeared at the clearing. At least they looked like kids since they were all pretty short."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a371808c:


    "A wolf boy, an owl girl and a bear boy."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_198e188f:


    "They all huffed and gasped for air, clearly tired from running around."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_61828efb:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/09 Ya.ogg"
    Noname "I thought you fell through the snow."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a3580c35:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/10 S.ogg"
    Noname "Started digging around, but couldn’t find you."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_edc39a8a:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/01 A.ogg"
    Noname "And I didn’t. Didn’t care enough."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_9f3b548e:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/02 O.ogg"
    Noname "You see, if you’re dumb, you run around and dig."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_28a9ecd0:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/03 Ae.ogg"
    Noname "And if you’re smart, you wait until the others get tired of running around and digging."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1fabc808:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/04 E.ogg"
    Noname "Then you start talking."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_34eaf921:



    voice "voice/Wolf/309 Kak.ogg"
    Noname "You’re a r-r-rat!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_f93e8529:



    voice "voice/Wolf/310 D.ogg"
    Noname " Degene-r-r-rat!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_aceacf69:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/137A.ogg"
    Ant "Huh?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_483fef82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/12 Neobr.ogg"
    Alis "Don’t mind him, he’s a weirdo."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_3b8fcacb:


    "I stood there stupefied, my mouth agape and my hands dangling helplessly."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_3370613a:


    "I had no idea how to react to the words of these late night guests, but I managed to squeeze out something resembling a smile."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_074923f5:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/138 V.ogg"
    Ant "You just scared me, that's all."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_4fb41b20:


    "They started looking at each other, and somebody even snorted, as if I said something funny."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_b849d4a1:



    voice "voice/Wolf/310 Da.ogg"
    Noname "Yes! Yes! The fox is r-r-right..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_4935c659:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/06 Eto.ogg"
    Noname "He's the one!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_6f0f6059:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/15 N.ogg"
    Alis "No, this is our..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a0d695e9:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/15 N.ogg"
    Noname "Have we finally found him?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_16be64c4:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/07 Na.ogg"
    Noname "Our bunny!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a777c8f6:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/16 D.ogg"
    Noname "Yes, he looks the part..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_b8a6b306:


    "The wolf boy started wagging a part of his costume like it was his tail, in excitement."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_49f017ed:



    voice "voice/Wolf/312 P.ogg"
    Noname "Fir-r-rst!"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_e816cfd0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/17 Nu.ogg"
    Alis "Of course, you were first."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_6142db16:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/18 Et.ogg"
    Alis "Wolfy here was the first to sense the Bunny in you. He told us about you."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1071845e:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/52 Zd.ogg"
    Ant "Hello."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_4a43d924:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/02 S.ogg"
    Alis "And you've already met our Hooty before. She isn't that scary, is she?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_1a349986:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/53 Da.ogg"
    Ant "I guess..."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_bdd81665:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/04 A.ogg"
    Alis "And this smiling big guy is Teddy."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_a7d86708:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/05 T.ogg"
    Alis "Be mindful with him or he'll chew off your head."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_b6cbf604:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/54 Za.ogg"
    Ant "What?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_f58f64ba:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/06 M.ogg"
    Alis "I see you've also dropped your sense of humor somewhere on the way here."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_e71dd051:


    "I was still unsure if these peculiar little animals had the best intentions in mind so I hid my hands behind my back, trying to look away from the gaping holes of their carnival masks."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_bec136b2:


    "Alisa put her hands to her sides in a theatrical manner and somehow managed to wink with her fox face."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_2d7d06d7:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/19 K.ogg"
    Alis "The next time we come, we’ll ring bells for you. That way you’ll be less scared of our visit."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_da040db9:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/01 A.ogg"
    Owl "Do we even have any bells?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_8f3b3a5a:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/09 Ch.ogg"
    Bear "I won’t be ringing."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_bf20dad7:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/10 U.ogg"
    Bear "My paw hurts."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_3b082654:


    "My smile was no longer fake."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_f0b0a64b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/13 Ozu.ogg"
    Alis "Ah, you showed us your teeth, that’s a good sign."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_f4798c41:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/14 Neo.ogg"
    Alis "I didn’t expect you to find us fun."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_6ed7db57:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/15 Ya.ogg"
    Alis "I thought it was an emotion reserved strictly to Disneyland."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_c73bd6d8:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/140 Otk.ogg"
    Ant "How do you know that?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_aeba8e4e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/20 Da.ogg"
    Alis "I read about it… somewhere…"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_8443a7ab:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/141 Pro.ogg"
    Ant "You read about me?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_ff500d94:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/24 Pr.ogg"
    Alis "Aren’t you funny! No, about Disneyland, darling."


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_d8fa0f28:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/12 T.ogg"
    Owl "You can read human?"


translate english dev_bunny3_candyjumps_end_49c09e0b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/25 Z.ogg"
    Alis "Do you think I’ve been going to school every day for nothing?"


translate english dev_d3_dance_82a8cae4:


    "And then she sang in a coquettish voice:"


translate english dev_d3_dance_0f7305ed:


    Alis "Where to learn about neglect? Where to get your dreams all wrecked? \nAt your local school, of course, and in your classroom!{w=7.367}{nw}"


translate english dev_d3_dance_42a1854c:


    Alis "Where to hit kids every week? Where to prey on all the meek? \nAt your local school, of course, and in your classroom!"


translate english dev_d3_dance_7b77ae2d:


    "I let out a cautious laugh."


translate english dev_d3_dance_7b479f9a:


    "My new acquaintances didn’t seem scary anymore. On the contrary, they looked friendly and welcoming."


translate english dev_d3_dance_8fa9069a:


    "There was something about them that attracted me."


translate english dev_d3_dance_2817a298:


    "Just like this clearing, this moon, and the snowflakes that fell backwards, from the ground to the sky, as if someone was rewinding a tape."


translate english dev_d3_dance_79c4994f:


    "The masked kids got close and I felt their touch: they gave me friendly taps, felt my clothes, as if checking whether I was real."


translate english dev_d3_dance_3625f588:


    "There was no animalistic malice in their touch, only pure childish curiosity."


translate english dev_d3_dance_dd393ce1:


    "For some reason, I thought to myself:"


translate english dev_d3_dance_a09953e9:


    Ant_m "{i}I can trust them.{/i}"


translate english dev_d3_dance_9350eaa2:


    "Snowflakes just kept on floating upwards."


translate english dev_d3_dance_6280243e:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/14 N.ogg"
    Owl "Nobody will hurt you anymore."


translate english dev_d3_dance_34c4abe3:



    voice "voice/Wolf/313 D.ogg"
    Wolf "F-grr-iend."


translate english dev_d3_dance_d50beac4:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/12 P.ogg"
    Bear "Yeah, if somebody even tries to…!"


translate english dev_d3_dance_030fbec3:


    "The fox gave me a slight tug and burst out laughing."


translate english dev_d3_dance_ef1594b5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/28 N.ogg"
    Alis "Well then, Tosha. Will you run away screaming or come with us?"


translate english dev_d3_dance_d5bafe11:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/143 Ku.ogg"
    Ant "Where to?"


translate english dev_d3_dance_94b2f8f8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/29 N.ogg"
    Alis "Ahaha! To the amusement park!"


translate english dev_d3_dance_7bbcc2ac:


    "At that moment, taiga’s deceptive silence was broken by the sound of a distant flute."


translate english dev_d3_dance_0619fc55:


    "Mesmerizing and alluring, it brought about the ring of crystal glass and the whispers of a fresh winter spring."


translate english beasts_sky_4efbbdb1:


    "If I had any doubts before, the flute’s song shattered the last of them."


translate english beasts_sky_d6a50f28:


    "I started following my new friends before I could even make my decision."


translate english beasts_sky_c287e515:


    "My legs carried me of their own will, and the tunnels made of pines stepped apart. Bushes bowed in front of our procession."


translate english beasts_sky_08f24ff4:


    "Everything looked dream-like."


translate english beasts_sky_bd378890:


    "Because even the clearing we ended up on I only saw in my dream."


translate english beasts_sky_660e14b6:


    "The flute soared up in the treetops, like some fantastical bird."


translate english beasts_sky_26e34a61:


    "The snowflakes floated up in a spiral."


translate english beasts_sky_db670388:


    "The Moon painted tree branches with silver."


translate english beasts_sky_027d1de4:


    "Alisa gasped in amazement. I was also in awe."


translate english beasts_sky_6f63c12e:


    "I tilted my head backwards as far as I could."


translate english beasts_sky_767eb594:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/15 K.ogg"
    Owl "Hoot, what a sight!"


translate english beasts_sky_79e7605f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/144 Och.ogg"
    Ant "It’s so beautiful."


translate english beasts_sky_ee192c5b:


    "Wolfy howled in agreement."


translate english beasts_sky_5ad141cd:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/31 E.ogg"
    Alis "This is nothing!"


translate english beasts_sky_fcd1c646:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/32 Ya.ogg"
    Alis "I can show you much more..."


translate english beasts_sky_5a0dde28:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/33 E.ogg"
    Alis "If you want."


translate english beasts_sky_c918fdfe:


    "I did want. I wanted to see what the fox girl saw with her eyes, hidden in the semi-dark of her cape!"


translate english beasts_sky_b118a3d8:


    "Now I didn’t feel weird about these masked kids, I felt weird for being the only one without a mask."


translate english beasts_sky_b86eee6c:


    "I felt like I was naked in the January winds."


translate english beasts_sky_a8649788:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/145 S.ogg"
    Ant "Why do you wear these masks?"


translate english beasts_sky_5b776bb7:


    "I was trembling, but I wasn’t scared."


translate english beasts_sky_85af34cd:


    "My trembling wasn’t caused by the cold, it originated from the peculiar anxiousness, the anticipation of something amazing."


translate english beasts_sky_32e90ab3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/07 At.ogg"
    Alis "And why do you ask?"


translate english beasts_sky_7bf3fea8:


    "I touched my cold cheek."


translate english beasts_sky_0c8adb92:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/146 No.ogg"
    Ant "I’m not wearing one."


translate english beasts_sky_b3eff0a9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/35 O.ogg"
    Alis "Ahaha! I love human tales!"


translate english beasts_sky_d2d52956:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/16 Ch.ogg"
    Owl "Human nails?"


translate english beasts_sky_352b9a1f:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/13 Ch.ogg"
    Bear "Human fails."


translate english beasts_sky_3dcdda7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/36 Ya.ogg"
    Alis "I’ve already told you..."


translate english beasts_sky_ae6320fb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/36 V.ogg"
    Alis "All the villagers wear masks."


translate english beasts_sky_790c7867:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/37 T.ogg"
    Alis "It’s just you won’t find anything human underneath them."


translate english beasts_sky_6ca4a7f3:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/147 E.ogg"
    Ant "Even me?"


translate english beasts_sky_f62fe49e:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/14 T.ogg"
    Bear "Hehehe, you’re so clumsy, Anton."


translate english beasts_sky_3fcc9371:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/17 Od.ogg"
    Owl "We’ve already found your glasses once already."


translate english beasts_sky_92813351:



    voice "voice/Wolf/315 E.ogg"
    Wolf "And you-grr hat!"


translate english beasts_sky_88d948c3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/38 E.ogg"
    Alis "And your real face."


translate english beasts_sky_21b9d1b3:


    "I looked at the mask the fox was holding out to me."


translate english beasts_sky_b5d9056f:


    "The bunny mask that looked like a silver ingot under the moonlight."


translate english beasts_sky_b62b955d:


    "I was curious to see the world through its slits."


translate english beasts_sky_b1547596:


    "Suddenly, fighting its way through the flute’s melody, a thought came to me: the glasses they found were in Semyon's possession."


translate english beasts_sky_a26ccb97:


    "My new acquaintances must have known what happened to him."


translate english beasts_sky_3b940a0c:


    "Or even worse..."


translate english beasts_sky_423947e8:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/148 A.ogg"
    Ant "And where did Semyon disappear to? What happened to him?"


translate english beasts_sky_b835c1c9:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/148 Es.ogg"
    Ant "And the other children…"


translate english beasts_sky_9edcc9f4:


    "The bear and the owl looked at each other."


translate english beasts_sky_ee1d937c:


    "The wolf boy curled into a ball, and the fox lowered the pointy nose of her mask."


translate english beasts_sky_5ee937df:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/18 T.ogg"
    Owl "The one who was kept in a cage!"


translate english beasts_sky_f1781e01:



    voice "voice/Wolf/316 T.ogg"
    Wolf "The one who cuts into little pieces, rawr!"


translate english beasts_sky_28a60d62:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/39 T.ogg"
    Alis "The one who wears a skin face took them."


translate english beasts_sky_a07fa368:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/15 Um.ogg"
    Bear "If I knew how to cross myself, I’d do it."


translate english beasts_sky_a872235f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/149 H.ogg"
    Ant "So you’re saying it was a human?"


translate english beasts_sky_97b0815f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/16 Chem.ogg"
    Alis "Were you even listening to us?"


translate english beasts_sky_5b84d1be:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/17 Razv.ogg"
    Alis "How can you call someone like him human?"


translate english beasts_sky_b49befe7:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/16 O.ogg"
    Bear "There’s just one word for him. An adult."


translate english beasts_sky_83e57ca3:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/19 V.ogg"
    Owl "It’s so easy to get lost in the adult world."


translate english beasts_sky_f21fa5b8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/42 U.ogg"
    Alis "Killers, cruel animal trainers and cold parents..."


translate english beasts_sky_28a51dd0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/43 L.ogg"
    Alis "Ah, if you don’t want to get sad, better not to think about them."


translate english beasts_sky_af9912bf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/44 A.ogg"
    Alis "I don’t know about you, but I definitely don’t want to be sad."


translate english beasts_sky_aa761324:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/17 E.ogg"
    Bear "Somehow, I’m also not sad today."


translate english beasts_sky_f6210c43:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/18 A.ogg"
    Bear "What about you, Anton?"


translate english beasts_sky_30e54b0a:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/150 A.ogg"
    Ant "Huh?"


translate english beasts_sky_42467c10:


    "I was lost in thought, staring at the pines, trying to pinpoint the location of the flute."


translate english beasts_sky_2d9da2a1:


    "I was sure that the person who played it was standing right behind the piny stockade."


translate english beasts_sky_4bea9629:


    "Someone tall, going over the holes in the flute with their long fingers."


translate english beasts_sky_41d8c2ca:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/20 T.ogg"
    Bear "What now? Are we gonna sit and be sad or have some fun?"


translate english beasts_sky_1ce8b728:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/151 Al.ogg"
    Ant "Alisa wanted to show me something..."


translate english beasts_sky_5e867f77:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/45 D.ogg"
    Alis "Let’s start with the sweet stuff!"


translate english beasts_sky_da07360b:


    "The fox girl took out a handful of candy from her pocket and handed them to each of the kids."


translate english beasts_sky_c8a18d93:


    "Covers shuffled. The smell of pineapple, cocoa and melon wafted through the air."


translate english beasts_sky_609678f6:


    "The last treat, a chocolate-covered waffle candy, Alisa put right into my mouth."


translate english beasts_sky_6d44dc94:


    "My tongue was engulfed in spiciness."


translate english beasts_sky_203dffc4:


    "I felt like my body was covered in fur and small sparks were running along it."


translate english beasts_sky_17fcfa24:


    "I chewed on the waffle and the chocolate, gulped them down, enjoying the vivid taste."


translate english beasts_sky_60c46fab:


    Ant "Thanks..."


translate english beasts_sky_e9cb7098:


    "My gratitude was barely audible because my lips were already touching the insides of a mask."


translate english beasts_sky_b6a68617:


    "I didn’t even notice how I put it against my face."


translate english beasts_sky_53cb6074:


    "The papier-mâché was warm. The mask stuck to my skin, giving it a nice prickle."


translate english beasts_sky_dcedf6bc:


    "The kind when you dive into a hot bath after being outside in winter, when you lie there and purr from the soapy water."


translate english beasts_sky_138737ec:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/47 G.ogg"
    Alis "See, I told you! This is yours!"


translate english beasts_sky_56aec357:



    voice"voice/anton/3day/154 M.ogg"
    Ant "Mine!"


translate english beasts_sky_b1afe02b:



    voice "voice/Bear/3day/21 Ch.ogg"
    Bear "What are we waiting for? The fun won’t have itself!"


translate english beasts_sky_21310ee3:



    voice "voice/Owl/3day/21 E.ogg"
    Owl "You’re right!"


translate english beasts_sky_1e60c89c:


    "The melody kept swirling in the field like a hurricane."


translate english beasts_sky_c458ee4a:


    "I couldn’t wait to release the energy, the heat that this enchanting music was filling me with."


translate english beasts_sky_69a1a09d:


    "The owl jumped and disappeared into the sky."


translate english beasts_sky_82e540f6:


    "I heard her laughter from somewhere above, and then she landed back, huffing and sighing."


translate english beasts_sky_0c6129f9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/48 E.ogg"
    Alis "You can do it, too! Give it a try!"


translate english beasts_sky_1d25fc8f:


    "I followed suit."


translate english beasts_sky_64129bee:


    "My feet tore off from the ground, I flew toward the stars like a rocket and screamed from happiness after seeing my friends down below."


translate english beasts_sky_b9e86728:


    "The wind helped me fly. It felt like I was jumping on a huge trampoline. "


translate english beasts_sky_cce17748:


    Narrator_color "The stars looked like vivid sparkles that I could reach and lick up."


translate english beasts_sky_1cb6d5e3:


    Narrator_color "The moon also got closer... And then I plunged."


translate english beasts_sky_0a78d3d0:


    Narrator_color "I got scared that I’d break my legs for a moment, but my soles landed softly on the ground and I regained my balance."


translate english beasts_sky_9eb58680:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/49 S.ogg"
    Alis_Color "You’re safe with us!"


translate english beasts_sky_0256a9de:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/50 E.ogg"
    Alis_Color "And all your dreams will come true!"


translate english beasts_sky_1d38266e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/51 Ya.ogg"
    Alis_Color "I’m so happy that I’ve finally found you..."


translate english beasts_sky_00371ad9:



    voice "voice/Alisa/3day/52 Z.ogg"
    Alis_Color "Bunny."


translate english beasts_sky_6ffd835a:


    Narrator_color "In a fit of merry laughter, I realized the most important thing: these four are not a threat."


translate english beasts_sky_472985bb:


    Narrator_color "My real enemies, and I felt that with every single hair on my mask, were those who knew nothing about magic."


translate english beasts_sky_69e6dd6b:


    Narrator_color "Humans from the village."


translate english beasts_sky_1aa91998:


    Narrator_color "I also realized how alive my surrounding have become."


translate english beasts_sky_0e6fcd7f:


    Narrator_color "I heard the dry grass under the snow moan. I saw faces of the trees and the stars. The trees were smirking and the stars were grimacing in fear."


translate english beasts_sky_10318250:


    Narrator_color "{i}That's right! Be scared! I'll jump up to you, and...{/i}"


translate english beasts_sky_ad2b5d27:


    Narrator_color "I snapped my teeth, then let out a jubilant laugh, jumping up along with the fox."


translate english beasts_sky_7a9bbd8d:


    Narrator_color "We flew higher than the tallest pines and stayed in the air."


translate english beasts_sky_abab8bee:


    Narrator_color "I swirled, Alisa followed my rhythm."


translate english beasts_sky_0cdea2f7:


    Narrator_color "I knew that she was smiling so I smiled, too."


translate english beasts_sky_91040269:


    Narrator_color "And the flute just kept on playing, carrying us higher and higher!."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_efb0865f:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/67 Ti.ogg"
    Rom "Hey, got your head in the clouds again?"


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_fe4f7471:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/108 E.ogg"
    Pol "Hey, did someone put a spell on you?"


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_ee452fcf:


    "\"Not with you around,\" I thought, trying to unglue my chin from the desk."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_9439ffa1:


    "\"That someone is standing next to me,\" I thought, trying to unglue my chin from the desk."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_7e950f17:


    "My muscles felt slightly sore, but that feeling was pleasant. "


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_41aeb84e:


    "The whole class was wandering about for some reason, whispering and passing notes to each other."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_ecc10028:


    "Their faces looked like discolored masks to me: bleak and boring. "


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_5e673bdc:


    "I yawned, remembering the time I was soaring high above the forest with Alisa by my side, laughing and squeezing my hand."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_4946feda:


    "Perhaps, no, probably, it was all just a dream."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_1c374cc2:


    "Because I didn’t walk back from the forest, just woke up in my bed on a normal morning with tea and medicine. "


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_4ac7f36e:


    "Still, I was hardly worried about trying to find a rational explanation for my night dance."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_f84b49b0:


    "That feeling of flight was much more important. "


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_6aab3422:


    "The knowledge of how it feels to be hanging in the air above the treetops of majestic pines and baring my teeth at the Moon."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_77850305:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/2. Nu.ogg"
    Ant "What do you want?"


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_173a4201:



    voice "voice/romka/3day/68 Cho.ogg"
    Rom "What do I want...? While you were nodding off here, Katya went missing."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_fd1e13e5:


    "My sleepiness was gone in an instant. I frowned in suspicion."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_a3237693:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/7. Pr.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, I got lost in thought."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_cb3f51ad:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/109 S.ogg"
    Pol "Have you heard about Katya?"


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_76f4b8d1:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/6. A.ogg"
    Ant "Huh?"


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_c29678e9:


    "I glanced at the empty seat in front of me. "


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_25ae1fd9:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/110.ogg"
    Pol "Katya went missing."


translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_fd1e13e5_1:


    "My sleepiness was gone in an instant. I frowned in suspicion."



translate english dev_day3_end_titr_end_f1e7e58b:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/3 Kak.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean? It can't be!"

