translate english day3_draw_witness_class_0837a6f3:



    voice "voice/Child/3day/08 Ant.ogg"
    Classmate "Can you draw me, Anton?"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_e65d1d78:



    voice "voice/Child/3day/09 E.ogg"
    Classmate "Me too! Draw me, draw me!"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_62372d66:



    voice "voice/Child/3day/10 A.ogg"
    Classmate "Did you learn to draw by yourself?"


translate english day3_draw_witness_class_3339e814:



    voice "voice/Child/3day/11 Mo.ogg"
    Classmate "Can you draw Van Damme? I'll hang it in my room as a poster!"


translate english day3_amulet_yes_dcdb442f:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/156 Horosh.ogg"
    Ant "Alright, let’s try to start over."


translate english day3_amulet_no_f6563c33:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/156 Bilo.ogg"
    Ant "Why would I?"


translate english open_box_table_472c2a8a:


    "Bits of TV shows started flashing on the CRT screen when I armed myself with the remote to look for the channel with the sought-after \"Dendy\" signal."


translate english day3_draw_fox_5602cd31:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/88 BL.ogg"
    Bya "Sure as fuck, guys! It’s the local {u}Chikatilo{/u}, eh."


translate english day3_amulet_before_4fcf92dc:



    voice "voice/anton/3day/58 V.ogg"
    Ant "You called him differently a week ago, when we were fighting."


translate english day3_amulet_before_5fbb6f33:



    voice "voice/Polina/3day/24 Ya.ogg"
    Pol "I… Well, I really thought I would be able to help you."


translate english dev_day3_anketa_after_e287da2e:


    "I took a long time to decide on my favorite musician until a trendy pop band \"{u}Car-Man{/u}\" came to mind with the cool dancers in their music videos."


translate english d3_look_projector_9dacffb3:


    "And old, cheap slide projector. I called this model a “tank” because it looked like one."


translate english d3_look_projector_f423b508:


    "I remember “Little Raccoon and one-who-sits-in-the-pond”, Kipling’s “Mowgli”, and many others."


translate english d3_look_esenin_f950332c:


    "I looked at the portraits of classical writers. My eyes stopped on Esenin’s photo."


translate english d3_look_box_8c9fbcf5:


    "A box of \"Corsair\" firecrackers."


translate english d3_look_box_257a8197:


    "Every boy my age I knew had something like this in his arsenal. Powder firecrackers that blow up with a very loud sound."


translate english d3_look_box_e95053b2:


    "Especially the \"Black Corsair\" type. They won’t be enough to blow up plastic soldiers, but when it comes to stuff made of plaster, they should work."


translate english day_3_continue_412828f5:


    "\"Everyone, look! Baburin snatched his glasses yesterday! And now he has them back! Murderer!\""


translate english day3_suefa_d211242b:



    voice "voice/byasha/3day/112 Da.ogg"
    Bya "Broke as fuck, eh!"


translate english open_box_table_9a7ef6ab:


    "I was still unsure whether I did the right thing by stealing a crucial piece of evidence from the police."


translate english open_box_table_fdfbcba3:


    "She dug her face into my chest and I could feel my shirt becoming wet."


translate english day_3_continue_46e6ac74:


    "Girls from the second row also leaned in, she shared something with them, too. Whispers, nods."



